e maturity and specialization of SageMaker Clarify for this exact scenario<br>upvoted 1 times<br>jainparag16 months ago<br>Selected Answer: C<br>C is correct.<br>upvoted 1 times<br>Thirukj6 months, 1 week ago<br>Selected Answer: C<br>Use Amazon SageMaker Clarify to evaluate fairness across demographic groups and publish metrics to CloudWatch for monitoring and<br>alarms.<br>upvoted 3 times<br>eesa6 months, 1 week ago<br>Selected Answer: C<br>Clarify puede generar análisis y reportes exportables, lo que encaja mejor con la comparación periódica entre dos enfoques de prompt. La<br>parte de “latency” en la opción C no es estrictamente necesaria para fairness, pero sigue siendo la alternativa que más se alinea con el<br>requerimiento general y con menos desarrollo a medida<br>upvoted 1 times<br>hedykim6 months, 1 week ago<br>Selected Answer: C<br>Bedrock Guardrails is a tool for the &#x27;safety&#x27; of content, not for measuring &#x27;statistical fairness&#x27;.<br>upvoted 1 times</div></details></details></div>"
