re the model receives sufficient context without exceeding limits.<br>https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/kb-chunking.html<br>upvoted 1 times<br>ArunRav5 months, 3 weeks ago<br>Changing to C.<br>upvoted 1 times<br>GiorgioGss6 months, 2 weeks ago<br>Selected Answer: C<br>C should be<br>upvoted 3 times<br>67bdb196 months, 2 weeks ago<br>Selected Answer: D<br>I&#x27;m thinking D. Can anyone confirm this?<br>upvoted 1 times</div></details></details></div>"
