      "slot": "p.2"
    },
    "</p>\r\n    <ul class=\"meta\">\r\n      <li>Prueba 1 · 阅读 25 题</li><li>Prueba 2 · 听力（官方未公开）</li><li>Prueba 3 · 写作 2 题</li><li>共 25 题可判分</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n  </div>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"layout\">\r\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\r\n  <div class=\"tbin\">\r\n    <div class=\"btns\">\r\n      <button id=\"btn-sheet\" type=\"button\">答题卡</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-report\" type=\"button\">交卷看成绩</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-wrong\" type=\"button\">只看错题</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-expand\" type=\"button\">展开全部解析</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-jump-l\" class=\"jump\" type=\"button\">跳到听力 →</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-jump-w\" class=\"jump\" type=\"button\">跳到写作 →</button>\r\n      <button id=\"btn-reset\" type=\"button\">清空重做</button>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"qbar\"><span>已答 <b id=\"s-done\">0</b>/<b>25</b></span><span>正确 <b id=\"s-ok\" class=\"ok\">0</b></span><span>错误 <b id=\"s-bad\" class=\"bad\">0</b></span><span>正确率 <b id=\"s-pct\">—</b></span><span class=\"pbar\"><i id=\"s-fill\"></i></span></div>\r\n    <div class=\"partstat\"><span><b>阅读 Prueba 1</b> <i id=\"ps-r\">未开始</i></span></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<main>\r\n<div class=\"wrap\">\r\n  <section class=\"block\" id=\"reading\">\r\n    <h2>",
