      "slot": "p.4"
    },
    "</p>\r\n    <section class=\"tarea\" id=\"t1\"><div class=\"thd\"><span class=\"tno\">Tarea 1</span><span class=\"tq\">题 1 – 5</span><span class=\"tkind\">选择题 · 从 A / B / C 中选出一个正确答案</span></div><p class=\"inst\" lang=\"es\">",
