    "</ol></section><section class=\"tarea\" id=\"t4\"><div class=\"thd\"><span class=\"tno\">Tarea 4</span><span class=\"tq\">题 20 – 25</span><span class=\"tkind\">选择题 · 从 A / B / C 中选出一个正确答案</span></div><p class=\"inst\" lang=\"es\">",
