    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: All Staff\r\nFrom: Office Management\r\nRe: Relocation to the Fifth Floor\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to announce that the Marketing and Sales departments (1)____ to the newly renovated fifth floor during the first week of August. The move is part of our ongoing effort to create a more collaborative workspace.\r\n\r\n(2)____ Boxes and labels will be distributed on July 28, and staff are asked to pack their personal belongings by the afternoon of July 31.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the fifth floor offers additional meeting rooms, which can be reserved (3)____ the online booking system. If you have any questions about the transition, do not (4)____ to contact the facilities team.</div>\r\n",
