    {
      "slot": "question.33"
    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: Professional Development Workshop\r\n\r\nGreen Valley Consulting will host a half-day workshop on effective business writing on Wednesday, September 14. The session (1)____ practical techniques for composing clear emails, reports, and proposals.\r\n\r\nAttendance is free for all employees, but space is limited to forty participants. Those who wish to attend should register (2)____ the deadline of September 7. (3)____ Once capacity is reached, registration will close automatically.\r\n\r\nParticipants who complete the workshop will receive a certificate for their professional records. We encourage everyone to take (4)____ of this valuable opportunity to sharpen their communication skills.</div>\r\n",
