    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\r\n\r\nBrightline Foods Opens Third Distribution Center\r\n\r\nBrightline Foods announced today that it has opened a new distribution center in Millbrook, its third facility in the region. (1)____ The 80,000-square-foot warehouse is expected to create more than 150 jobs over the next two years.\r\n\r\nThe new center will allow the company to (2)____ orders more quickly to retailers across the northeast. &quot;Faster delivery times are exactly what our customers have been asking for,&quot; said CEO Dana Whitfield.\r\n\r\nCompany officials noted that the location was chosen (3)____ of its proximity to major highways. Construction of the facility, which began last spring, was completed (4)____ ahead of schedule.</div>\r\n",
