    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Mr. Alvarez,\r\n\r\nThank you for your recent inquiry about our premium subscription service. We are delighted that you are considering an (1)____ to your current plan.\r\n\r\nThe premium tier includes unlimited cloud storage, priority technical support, and access to advanced reporting tools. Many of our clients find that these features (2)____ them a considerable amount of time each week.\r\n\r\nIf you decide to upgrade before the end of the month, we would be happy to offer you a ten percent discount on your first year. This offer is (3)____ to new premium subscribers only.\r\n\r\nShould you have any questions, our support team is available around the clock. (4)____\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nCustomer Success Team</div>\r\n",
