      "slot": "h2.6"
    },
    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL TENANTS\r\nGreenfield Office Tower\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that the north elevator will be out of service from Monday, August 3, through Wednesday, August 5, while our contractor completes its annual safety inspection and cable replacement. During this period, tenants and visitors should use the south elevator or the central stairwell.\r\n\r\nTo reduce congestion, we ask that any large deliveries be scheduled before 9:00 A.M. or after 4:00 P.M. The freight elevator at the rear of the building remains available for heavy items; please contact the management office at extension 200 to arrange access.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your patience and apologize for any inconvenience.\r\n— Building Management</div>\r\n",
    {
      "slot": "question.46"
    },
    "\r\n\r\n",
    {
      "slot": "question.47"
    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">HARBORPOINT WORKSPACES\r\nWhere independent professionals get things done.\r\n\r\nNow open in the Riverside District! Harborpoint offers flexible desks, private offices, and bookable meeting rooms just steps from the ferry terminal. Every membership includes high-speed internet, unlimited coffee, and 24-hour secure access.\r\n\r\nJoin before September 30 and pay no registration fee — a savings of $75. Day passes are also available for $25 if you would like to try us first.\r\n\r\nTour the space any weekday between 10 A.M. and 5 P.M. No appointment necessary. Visit www.harborpointwork.com or call (555) 0140 to learn more.</div>\r\n",
    {
      "slot": "question.48"
    },
    "\r\n\r\n",
