      "slot": "question.49"
    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Rachel Kim (10:38 A.M.): Hi Tom, are you still at the downtown warehouse?\r\nTom Alvarez (10:39 A.M.): Just leaving now. Why, what&#x27;s up?\r\nRachel Kim (10:40 A.M.): The client moved the site visit up to noon instead of 2. Can the samples be there by then?\r\nTom Alvarez (10:42 A.M.): That&#x27;s cutting it close. Traffic on the bridge is backed up.\r\nRachel Kim (10:43 A.M.): Could you take the tunnel instead?\r\nTom Alvarez (10:44 A.M.): Good call. I&#x27;ll reroute now and text you when I&#x27;m ten minutes out.\r\nRachel Kim (10:45 A.M.): Perfect, thank you!</div>\r\n",
