    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Dr. Elena Vasquez\r\nFrom: Marcus Bell, Program Chair\r\nSubject: Your session at the Northeast Data Summit\r\nDate: June 12\r\n\r\nDear Dr. Vasquez,\r\n\r\nThank you for agreeing to speak at this year&#x27;s Northeast Data Summit on July 22. I am writing to confirm the details of your session and to request a few materials.\r\n\r\nYour talk, &quot;Ethics in Automated Decision-Making,&quot; is scheduled for 11:00 A.M. in the Birchwood Room, with a 45-minute slot that includes time for questions. Could you please send a short biography (about 100 words) and the title of your presentation as you would like it printed in the program by June 30?\r\n\r\nWe will provide a laptop, projector, and microphone, so you need only bring your slides on a USB drive. If you require any additional equipment, just let me know and we will make arrangements.\r\n\r\nWe are honored to have you join us.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nMarcus Bell</div>\r\n",
