    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 159–161 refer to the following Memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MEMORANDUM\r\n\r\nTo: All Marketing Department Staff\r\nFrom: Priya Nadar, Operations Manager\r\nDate: March 4\r\nRe: New procedure for supply requests\r\n\r\nBeginning Monday, March 10, all office-supply requests must be submitted through the online portal rather than by email. This change will help us track spending and reduce the delays many of you have experienced.\r\n\r\nTo submit a request, log in to the portal with your employee ID, select &quot;Supplies,&quot; and choose the items you need. Requests under $50 will be approved automatically. Requests of $50 or more will be routed to me for review and are typically approved within one business day.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the supply closet on the fourth floor will no longer be stocked with printer toner; toner must now be ordered through the portal. If you have questions, stop by my office or reach me at extension 145.</div>\r\n",
