    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 165–167 refer to the following Review.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Reviewed by Kenji T.  ★★★★☆\r\nStayed at the Lakeside Inn for three nights.\r\n\r\nThe Lakeside Inn exceeded my expectations for a mid-range hotel. My room was spotless, the bed was comfortable, and the desk was large enough to spread out my work — a detail many hotels overlook. The complimentary breakfast was fresh and included plenty of options, though it ended a bit early at 9 A.M., which was inconvenient on the morning of a late meeting.\r\n\r\nThe staff deserve special praise. When my presentation remote stopped working, the front desk found a spare within minutes. The only real drawback was the noise from the highway, which I noticed at night. If you&#x27;re a light sleeper, ask for a room facing the lake.\r\n\r\nOverall, I would happily stay here again and recommend it to other business travelers.</div>\r\n",
