    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following Letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Thornhill Stationery Co.\r\n47 Maple Avenue, Brenton\r\n\r\nApril 2\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Okafor,\r\n\r\nAs one of our most valued customers, you are among the first to hear about an exciting change at Thornhill Stationery. Starting May 1, we are launching Thornhill Rewards, a program designed to thank businesses like yours for their continued loyalty.\r\n\r\nUnder the new program, every dollar you spend earns one point, and points can be redeemed for account credit, free delivery, or exclusive seasonal products. Because your account has been active for more than five years, we have credited you with 2,000 bonus points to start — enough for a full month of free delivery.\r\n\r\nThere is no cost to enroll, and no action is required on your part; your account has already been activated. You can review your point balance at any time by logging in to your online account.\r\n\r\nWe are grateful for your business and look forward to continuing to serve you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nGrace Thornhill\r\nCustomer Relations Manager</div>\r\n",
