    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: orders@garden-plate.com\r\nFrom: l.chen@brightpath.org\r\nSubject: Catering for staff appreciation lunch\r\nDate: September 3\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI am organizing a staff appreciation lunch for Brightpath Community Center and would like a quote for catering. The event will take place on Friday, September 26, from 12:30 to 2:00 P.M. at our center on Dover Road.\r\n\r\nWe expect about 60 guests. Roughly a third of them are vegetarian, and we have two guests with nut allergies, so clear labeling of the dishes is important. We would prefer a buffet-style setup so people can serve themselves.\r\n\r\nOur budget is approximately $1,200, including delivery and setup. Could you let me know what options you can offer within that range, and whether you can accommodate the dietary needs? We would also need the food to arrive by 12:00 so we have time to set up.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nLiwei Chen\r\nProgram Coordinator, Brightpath Community Center</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: l.chen@brightpath.org\r\nFrom: orders@garden-plate.com\r\nSubject: RE: Catering for staff appreciation lunch\r\nDate: September 4\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Chen,\r\n\r\nThank you for thinking of Garden Plate Catering. We would be delighted to cater your lunch on September 26, and I&#x27;m pleased to say we can work within your budget.\r\n\r\nFor 60 guests, I recommend our Harvest Buffet at $18 per person, which comes to $1,080 and includes a delivery and setup fee. The menu features a hot main, two salads, seasonal vegetables, and bread. We can easily make half of the mains vegetarian, and every dish is labeled with a full ingredient list, which also flags common allergens such as nuts.\r\n\r\nDelivery by 12:00 is no problem; our team typically arrives 45 minutes before the meal to arrange everything. To confirm your booking, we ask for a 25 percent deposit, which you can pay by phone or online.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you would like to proceed, or if you&#x27;d prefer to adjust the menu.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nFatima Noor\r\nGarden Plate Catering</div>\r\n",
