    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 181–185 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.lumen-analytics.com/careers\r\n\r\nLumen Analytics — Junior Data Analyst (Riverside Office)\r\n\r\nLumen Analytics helps retail clients turn data into decisions. We are seeking a Junior Data Analyst to join our growing Riverside team.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Prepare weekly sales reports and dashboards for client accounts\r\n• Clean and organize data from multiple sources\r\n• Support senior analysts in presenting findings to clients\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n• A bachelor&#x27;s degree in statistics, economics, or a related field\r\n• At least one year of experience working with spreadsheets and databases\r\n• Strong written communication skills\r\n• Experience with a data-visualization tool (such as Tableau) is preferred but not required\r\n\r\nWe offer a competitive salary, health benefits, and a professional-development budget of $1,500 per year. This is a full-time, on-site position.\r\n\r\nTo apply, send your résumé and a brief cover letter to careers@lumen-analytics.com by March 15. Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: careers@lumen-analytics.com\r\nFrom: samuel.otieno@mail.com\r\nSubject: Application for Junior Data Analyst\r\nDate: March 6\r\n\r\nDear Hiring Team,\r\n\r\nI am writing to apply for the Junior Data Analyst position at your Riverside office. I have attached my résumé and cover letter as requested.\r\n\r\nI graduated last year with a degree in economics, and for the past 18 months I have worked part-time as a data assistant at a small marketing firm, where I built weekly spreadsheets and cleaned survey data. Although the job posting lists it as optional, I have also completed an online certificate in Tableau and enjoy creating clear, visual dashboards.\r\n\r\nI am excited by the idea of working directly with retail clients, and I am available to start immediately. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nSamuel Otieno</div>\r\n",
