    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.cedarhall-venue.com/packages\r\n\r\nCedar Hall Conference Center — Room &amp; Package Rates\r\n\r\nCedar Hall offers flexible spaces for meetings, workshops, and corporate events in the heart of downtown.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Aspen Room — seats up to 40 — $300 per day\r\n• The Willow Room — seats up to 80 — $500 per day\r\n• The Grand Oak Hall — seats up to 200 — $900 per day\r\n\r\nAdd-on packages (per attendee):\r\n• Refreshment Package: morning and afternoon coffee, tea, and pastries — $12\r\n• Lunch Package: hot buffet lunch — $22\r\n• Full-Day Package: refreshments plus lunch — $30 (save $4)\r\n\r\nAll rooms include a projector, screen, and free Wi-Fi. Bookings must be confirmed at least two weeks in advance. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of three or more consecutive days.\r\n\r\nTo reserve, e-mail bookings@cedarhall-venue.com with your preferred date, room, and package.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: bookings@cedarhall-venue.com\r\nFrom: r.delacruz@nova-training.com\r\nSubject: Booking request for October 14\r\nDate: September 20\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI would like to book a room for a one-day leadership workshop on Tuesday, October 14. We are expecting 55 participants, so we will need a room that comfortably seats that many.\r\n\r\nPlease include the Full-Day Package for all attendees, as the workshop runs from 9 A.M. to 5 P.M. and we would like to keep everyone on-site for meals. We will also need two flip charts if those can be arranged.\r\n\r\nCould you send an invoice once everything is confirmed? Our finance team requires it before they can process payment.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nRosa Dela Cruz\r\nNova Training Solutions</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">CEDAR HALL CONFERENCE CENTER\r\nINVOICE #CH-2214\r\nBill to: Nova Training Solutions\r\nEvent date: October 14\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nWillow Room (1 day) ...................... $500.00\r\nFull-Day Package — 55 attendees × $30 .. $1,650.00\r\nFlip chart rental (2) .................... $40.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $2,190.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$547.50\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $1,642.50\r\n\r\nPayment due by October 7. Thank you for choosing Cedar Hall.</div>\r\n",
