    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 191–195 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MERIDIAN COMMUNITY LEARNING CENTER\r\nFall Evening Workshop Series\r\n\r\nSharpen your skills this autumn! Our popular evening workshops are back, led by experienced local instructors. Each workshop meets once a week for four weeks. Classes are small, so early registration is recommended.\r\n\r\nThis term&#x27;s offerings:\r\n• Introduction to Public Speaking\r\n• Personal Finance Basics\r\n• Digital Photography\r\n• Conversational Spanish\r\n\r\nFees: $80 per workshop, or $140 for any two. Materials are included, except for Digital Photography, which requires participants to bring their own camera. Members of the center receive a 15 percent discount.\r\n\r\nRegister online at www.meridianlearn.org or in person at the front desk by September 12.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Fall Evening Workshop Schedule — Meridian Community Learning Center\r\nAll sessions run 6:30–8:00 P.M.\r\n\r\nWorkshop ......................... Day ....... Room\r\nIntroduction to Public Speaking .. Monday .... Room A\r\nPersonal Finance Basics .......... Tuesday ... Room B\r\nDigital Photography .............. Wednesday . Room C\r\nConversational Spanish ........... Thursday .. Room B\r\n\r\nSessions begin the week of September 15. Please arrive ten minutes early to the first session to collect your materials.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: info@meridianlearn.org\r\nFrom: h.bergstrom@mail.com\r\nSubject: Workshop registration question\r\nDate: September 8\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI registered last week for two workshops — Personal Finance Basics and Conversational Spanish — and I&#x27;m looking forward to them. However, I want to make sure I haven&#x27;t made a mistake with the dates.\r\n\r\nCould you confirm that the two workshops meet on different evenings? I work late on Tuesdays and may need to switch out of one of them if there is a conflict. If Personal Finance is indeed on a day I can&#x27;t attend, is it possible to move into Digital Photography instead?\r\n\r\nAlso, I am a center member, so I believe I should receive the member discount on my total.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nHenrik Bergstrom</div>\r\n",
