    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 196–200 refer to the following Article.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Bowl &amp; Grain Opens Fourth Location Downtown\r\n\r\nBowl &amp; Grain, the fast-casual chain known for its build-your-own grain bowls, opened its fourth city location on Prescott Street last week. The new branch is the company&#x27;s largest yet and the first to stay open until 10 P.M. on weekends.\r\n\r\nTo celebrate the opening, Bowl &amp; Grain is offering a free drink with any bowl through the end of the month. The company also announced a new mobile app that lets customers order ahead and earn a free bowl for every ten purchased.\r\n\r\n&quot;We built the app because our regulars told us they wanted to skip the lunchtime line,&quot; said marketing director Nina Fales. Customer feedback, she added, continues to shape the menu; a new roasted-vegetable bowl was added this spring after repeated requests.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">★★★☆☆  Reviewed by Marta L.\r\n\r\nI visited the new Prescott Street location on a Saturday evening, mostly because I saw it was open late — a big plus after a movie. The bowl was fresh and generous, and I appreciated the free drink promotion.\r\n\r\nMy one complaint is the app. I downloaded it to order ahead, but it crashed twice and never applied my loyalty points, so I ended up ordering at the counter anyway. The staff were apologetic and friendly about it. I&#x27;ll come back for the food and the late hours, but I hope they fix the app soon.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: marta.l@mail.com\r\nFrom: n.fales@bowlandgrain.com\r\nSubject: Thank you for your feedback\r\nDate: June 2\r\n\r\nDear Marta,\r\n\r\nThank you for taking the time to review our new Prescott Street location. I&#x27;m delighted that you enjoyed the food and our extended weekend hours, but I&#x27;m sorry the app did not work as it should have.\r\n\r\nOur development team has identified the issue you described with loyalty points and released a fix this week. As an apology, I&#x27;ve added 200 points to your account — enough for a free bowl on your next visit. Simply log in to the app to see them.\r\n\r\nWe&#x27;re grateful for feedback like yours; it genuinely helps us improve. I hope to see you again soon.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nNina Fales\r\nMarketing Director, Bowl &amp; Grain</div>\r\n",
