    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: All Staff\r\nFrom: Human Resources\r\nRe: New Flexible Start-Time Policy\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to announce that, beginning October 1, employees (1)____ to choose their own start time between 7:30 and 9:30 A.M. Core hours, when everyone is expected to be present, will run from 10:00 A.M. to 3:00 P.M.\r\n\r\n(2)____ Your total number of working hours each day will remain unchanged; whatever start time you select, you will simply finish eight hours later.\r\n\r\nTo help managers plan coverage, please inform your team leader of your preferred schedule (3)____ September 24. If your role requires you to be available at specific times, your manager will discuss this with you (4)____.\r\n\r\nWe believe this change will improve work-life balance across the company.</div>\r\n",
