    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: Lunchtime Language Classes\r\n\r\nBeginning next month, Hartwell Corporation will offer free Spanish classes for employees during the lunch hour. The classes (1)____ by a certified instructor from the Riverton Language School.\r\n\r\nSessions will be held every Tuesday and Thursday from 12:15 to 12:55 in Meeting Room C. Because space is limited, employees must sign up (2)____ the front desk before the first session. (3)____ Anyone who registers after that will be added to a waiting list.\r\n\r\nBeginners are welcome, and no prior experience is (4)____. We hope many of you will take this chance to learn a new skill.</div>\r\n",
