    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\r\n\r\nVolta Motors Unveils Compact Electric Van\r\n\r\nVolta Motors today introduced the Volta Mini-E, a compact electric delivery van aimed at small businesses. (1)____ The vehicle can travel up to 180 miles on a single charge and recharges fully in under four hours.\r\n\r\nThe company says the van (2)____ growing demand from urban couriers seeking cleaner, cheaper alternatives to diesel vehicles. &quot;City deliveries are exactly where electric vans make the most sense,&quot; said product manager Leah Song.\r\n\r\nVolta expects the Mini-E to be (3)____ available in early spring, with pre-orders opening next week. Analysts have praised the company (4)____ its focus on the fast-growing small-business market.</div>\r\n",
