    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Ms. Harlow,\r\n\r\nThank you for contacting us about the standing desk you purchased last month. We are sorry to hear that the height adjustment (1)____ properly.\r\n\r\nBased on your description, it is likely that the control panel simply needs to be reset. We have attached a short guide that (2)____ you through the steps. Most customers find that this resolves the issue within a few minutes.\r\n\r\nIf the problem continues after you have tried the reset, we would be happy to send a replacement panel at no additional (3)____ to you. Simply reply to this message and we will arrange shipment right away. (4)____\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nCustomer Care Team</div>\r\n",
