    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL EMPLOYEES\r\nMaple Street Parking Lot\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that the main employee parking lot on Maple Street will be closed for resurfacing from Thursday, June 11, through Saturday, June 13. During this period the lot will be completely inaccessible, and any vehicles left overnight on Wednesday must be removed by 6:00 P.M.\r\n\r\nWhile the work is underway, employees may park free of charge in the municipal garage on Third Avenue. Please bring your parking receipt to the reception desk for reimbursement.\r\n\r\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your cooperation.\r\n— Facilities Department</div>\r\n",
