    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">CORE &amp; CALM STUDIO\r\nMove better. Feel better.\r\n\r\nNow enrolling for our summer session! Core &amp; Calm offers small-group classes in yoga, pilates, and strength training, all led by certified instructors in our bright, newly renovated studio on Lyndon Avenue.\r\n\r\nSign up before June 1 and your first month is half price. New members also receive a free fitness assessment to help set personal goals. Not sure yet? Drop-in classes are available for $18 each.\r\n\r\nClasses run seven days a week, morning and evening. View the full schedule and reserve your spot at www.coreandcalm.com.</div>\r\n",
