    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Olivia Grant (2:05 P.M.): Hey, did the projector for the 3:00 client pitch get delivered?\r\nDerek Malone (2:07 P.M.): It came, but it&#x27;s the wrong model — no HDMI port.\r\nOlivia Grant (2:08 P.M.): Oh no. My laptop only has HDMI. Can we borrow one from the design team?\r\nDerek Malone (2:10 P.M.): Already on it. Priya says we can use theirs, but someone needs to grab it from the fourth floor.\r\nOlivia Grant (2:11 P.M.): I&#x27;ll go now. Can you set up the room while I&#x27;m gone?\r\nDerek Malone (2:12 P.M.): Consider it done.</div>\r\n",
