    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Priya Ramesh\r\nFrom: Owen Blackwood, Events Coordinator\r\nSubject: Your booth at the Harvest Trade Fair\r\nDate: August 5\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Ramesh,\r\n\r\nThank you for registering Ramesh Organics for this year&#x27;s Harvest Trade Fair on September 10. I am writing to confirm your booth assignment and to request a few details.\r\n\r\nYour booth, number 42, is located in the main hall near the north entrance, an area that typically sees heavy foot traffic. Setup begins at 7:00 A.M., and the fair opens to the public at 9:00. Could you please send the name of your on-site contact and a list of any electrical equipment you plan to use by August 25?\r\n\r\nWe will provide a table, two chairs, and a signboard with your company name. If you need additional furniture, it can be rented through our supplier at a modest cost.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to a successful event.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nOwen Blackwood</div>\r\n",
