    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 159–161 refer to the following Memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MEMORANDUM\r\n\r\nTo: All Warehouse Staff\r\nFrom: Grace Okonkwo, Operations Manager\r\nDate: February 2\r\nRe: Updated end-of-shift procedure\r\n\r\nEffective Monday, February 9, all staff must follow a new end-of-shift checklist before leaving the floor. This change is intended to improve safety and reduce equipment damage overnight.\r\n\r\nAt the end of each shift, please do the following: return all handheld scanners to the charging rack, switch off and unplug the shrink-wrap machines, and confirm that the loading-bay doors are fully closed. Team leads will complete a short sign-off sheet posted by the exit.\r\n\r\nPlease note that forklifts should be parked in the marked bay but left plugged in to charge overnight. If you have questions, see me or your team lead before Friday.</div>\r\n",
