    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: rentals@stagecraftav.com\r\nFrom: t.okoro@fairwindconf.org\r\nSubject: AV equipment for annual gala\r\nDate: April 10\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI am coordinating the Fairwind Foundation&#x27;s annual gala and would like a quote for audiovisual equipment. The event is on Saturday, May 16, at the Lakeview Ballroom, running from 6:00 to 10:00 P.M.\r\n\r\nWe will need two wireless microphones for speeches, a projector and screen for a short slideshow, and background sound for about 250 guests. Setup must be finished by 5:00 P.M., as guests begin arriving at 5:30.\r\n\r\nOur budget for equipment and an on-site technician is around $900. Could you tell me what you can offer within that range, and whether a technician can remain for the whole evening in case of any issues?\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nTobias Okoro</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: t.okoro@fairwindconf.org\r\nFrom: rentals@stagecraftav.com\r\nSubject: RE: AV equipment for annual gala\r\nDate: April 11\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Okoro,\r\n\r\nThank you for considering Stagecraft AV. We can certainly meet your needs for May 16 and stay within your budget.\r\n\r\nOur Event Package at $850 includes two wireless microphones, a high-brightness projector with a 12-foot screen, and a speaker system suitable for a room of your size. Importantly, the package includes an on-site technician who will arrive for setup and stay until the equipment is packed away at the end of the night.\r\n\r\nWe can have everything installed and tested by 4:30 P.M., leaving a comfortable margin before your guests arrive. To secure the date, we ask for a signed rental agreement and a 30 percent deposit.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you would like to proceed.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nDana Whitlock\r\nStagecraft AV</div>\r\n",
