    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.willowbrookretreat.com/meetings\r\n\r\nWillowbrook Retreat Center — Meeting Space Rates\r\n\r\nSet in quiet countryside, Willowbrook offers meeting rooms for corporate retreats, workshops, and training days.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Fern Room — seats up to 25 — $200 per day\r\n• The Cedar Room — seats up to 60 — $400 per day\r\n• The Grand Lodge — seats up to 150 — $750 per day\r\n\r\nCatering (per person):\r\n• Morning Package: coffee, tea, and pastries — $10\r\n• Lunch Package: two-course buffet — $20\r\n• Day Package: morning refreshments plus lunch — $26 (save $4)\r\n\r\nEvery room includes a projector, whiteboard, and free parking. Bookings must be confirmed at least ten days in advance. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of two or more days.\r\n\r\nTo reserve, e-mail events@willowbrookretreat.com.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: events@willowbrookretreat.com\r\nFrom: k.abara@nexuslogistics.com\r\nSubject: Booking for staff training day\r\nDate: July 1\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI would like to book a room for a one-day staff training on Thursday, July 24. We expect 48 people, so we will need a room that comfortably seats everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease include the Day Package for all attendees, as the session runs from 9 A.M. to 4:30 P.M. and we would like to keep everyone on-site for meals. We will also need a flip chart in addition to the whiteboard, if that can be arranged.\r\n\r\nCould you send an invoice once the booking is confirmed? Our accounts team needs it before they can release payment.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nKwame Abara\r\nNexus Logistics</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">WILLOWBROOK RETREAT CENTER\r\nINVOICE #WB-3390\r\nBill to: Nexus Logistics\r\nEvent date: July 24\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nCedar Room (1 day) ...................... $400.00\r\nDay Package — 48 attendees × $26 ....... $1,248.00\r\nFlip chart rental ....................... $25.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $1,673.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$418.25\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $1,254.75\r\n\r\nPayment due by July 17. Thank you for choosing Willowbrook.</div>\r\n",
