    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: All Employees\r\nFrom: Building Security\r\nRe: New Visitor Check-In Procedure\r\n\r\nStarting Monday, May 5, all visitors to our offices (1)____ to sign in using the new tablet at the reception desk. The tablet will print a temporary badge that must be worn at all times.\r\n\r\n(2)____ This means employees no longer need to fill out paper visitor logs. Instead, you will receive an automatic email the moment your guest checks in.\r\n\r\nPlease remind any visitors to bring a photo ID, as it is required (3)____ the sign-in process. If you are expecting a large group, contact reception ahead of time so they can prepare the badges (4)____.\r\n\r\nThank you for helping us keep the building secure.</div>\r\n",
