    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: New Secure Bike Storage\r\n\r\nWe are pleased to announce that a secure bicycle storage room (1)____ on the ground floor next month. The room will hold up to forty bikes and can be accessed with your employee key card.\r\n\r\nTo use the facility, staff must first register their bicycle (2)____ the building manager. Registration is free and takes only a few minutes. (3)____ Unregistered bikes may be removed without notice.\r\n\r\nWe hope this new facility will encourage more of you to cycle to work. Helmets and locks (4)____ available for purchase at a discount from the reception desk.\r\n\r\nFor questions, please contact building services.</div>\r\n",
