    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\r\n\r\nLumina Labs Launches Smart Desk Lamp\r\n\r\nLumina Labs today announced the release of the Aura, a smart desk lamp that adjusts its brightness automatically to match the surrounding light. (1)____ The lamp can also be controlled by a smartphone app and set to gradually brighten in the morning.\r\n\r\nThe company says the Aura (2)____ a common complaint from remote workers about eye strain during long hours at the screen. &quot;Good lighting makes a real difference to comfort and focus,&quot; said designer Priya Anand.\r\n\r\nThe Aura will be (3)____ available online next month, priced at ninety dollars. Early reviewers have praised the company (4)____ its clean, simple design.</div>\r\n",
