    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Mr. Nguyen,\r\n\r\nThank you for reaching out about the wireless headphones you ordered last week. We are sorry to hear that the left earpiece (1)____ any sound.\r\n\r\nFrom what you describe, the headphones may simply need to be re-paired with your device. We have included a short guide that (2)____ you through the process, which usually takes just a minute or two.\r\n\r\nIf the issue persists after re-pairing, we will gladly send you a replacement pair at no (3)____ to you. Just reply to this email with your order number and we will ship it the same day. (4)____\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nCustomer Support Team</div>\r\n",
