    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL TENANTS\r\nKingsway Business Center\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that the main lobby will undergo renovation from Monday, October 5, through Friday, October 9. During this time, the front entrance on Kingsway will be closed, and all tenants and visitors should use the side entrance on Palmer Lane.\r\n\r\nThe elevators and stairwells will remain fully operational throughout the work. Deliveries should be directed to the loading area at the rear of the building. We expect some noise between 9:00 A.M. and 4:00 P.M. and appreciate your understanding.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.\r\n— Property Management</div>\r\n",
