    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FRESH &amp; READY\r\nHome-cooked meals, minus the shopping.\r\n\r\nFresh &amp; Ready delivers a box of pre-measured ingredients and easy recipe cards straight to your door every week. Choose from vegetarian, seafood, or family menus, and cook a restaurant-quality dinner in about thirty minutes.\r\n\r\nSign up this week and get 40% off your first three boxes. There is no long-term contract — pause or cancel anytime. Delivery is always free.\r\n\r\nVisit www.freshandready.com to pick your first menu today.</div>\r\n",
