    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Rosa Marin (9:12 A.M.): Morning! Are the samples ready for the 11:00 buyer visit?\r\nNeil Patel (9:14 A.M.): Almost — the fabric swatches are packed, but the catalog didn&#x27;t print. Toner&#x27;s out.\r\nRosa Marin (9:15 A.M.): We can&#x27;t meet a buyer without the catalog. Any way to get toner fast?\r\nNeil Patel (9:17 A.M.): The shop on Beckett Street stocks it. I can be there and back in 40 minutes.\r\nRosa Marin (9:18 A.M.): Cutting it close but doable. Go now — I&#x27;ll finish packing the swatches.\r\nNeil Patel (9:19 A.M.): On my way.</div>\r\n",
