    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Daniel Ortega\r\nFrom: Ruth Kimani, Conference Organizer\r\nSubject: Confirmation — Riverside Tech Forum\r\nDate: May 3\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Ortega,\r\n\r\nThank you for agreeing to moderate a panel at the Riverside Tech Forum on June 5. I am writing to confirm the details and to ask for one item.\r\n\r\nYour panel, &quot;The Future of Remote Work,&quot; will run from 2:00 to 3:00 P.M. in the Maple Room. Four panelists have confirmed, and I will send you their biographies next week so you can prepare your questions. Could you please send me a short description of the panel, no more than 80 words, for our printed program by May 20?\r\n\r\nWe will provide water and microphones for all panelists, and a technician will be on hand throughout. Please arrive by 1:30 to test the equipment.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to a lively discussion.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nRuth Kimani</div>\r\n",
