    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 156–158 refer to the following Article.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MARLOW — Tideline Kayaks, a small outfitter that has rented kayaks on the Marlow waterfront for eight years, will begin offering guided evening paddling tours starting in June, owner Grace Bell confirmed.\r\n\r\nThe idea came from repeated requests by visitors. &quot;People kept asking if we ran tours, not just rentals,&quot; Ms. Bell said. &quot;The sunset paddles are something we&#x27;d been wanting to try for a while.&quot;\r\n\r\nEach tour will take no more than ten guests and will be led by a certified guide who points out local wildlife along the shoreline. Ms. Bell said the regular daytime rental business will continue as usual.\r\n\r\nThe first several tours are already fully booked, and the company plans to add weekend dates if demand stays strong.</div>\r\n",
