    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 159–161 refer to the following Memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MEMORANDUM\r\n\r\nTo: All Café Staff\r\nFrom: Leila Haddad, Store Manager\r\nDate: April 6\r\nRe: New opening-shift checklist\r\n\r\nBeginning Monday, April 13, all staff on the opening shift must complete a short checklist before we unlock the doors to customers. The goal is to make sure the café is fully ready when we open at 7:00 A.M.\r\n\r\nBefore opening, please: turn on and calibrate the espresso machines, stock the pastry case from the morning delivery, and check that the outdoor seating is wiped down. The shift lead will initial the checklist, which is posted by the register.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the floors are now cleaned by our overnight contractor, so opening staff no longer need to mop. If you have questions, speak with me before Friday.</div>\r\n",
