    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 162–164 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.hollowaygardens.org/visit\r\n\r\nPlan Your Visit — Holloway Botanic Gardens\r\n\r\nHours: Open daily, 8 A.M.–7 P.M. in summer and 8 A.M.–5 P.M. in winter.\r\n\r\nAdmission: Adults $10, seniors and students $7, children under six free. Annual members enjoy unlimited entry and a 10 percent discount in the gift shop. On the last Sunday of every month, admission is free for all visitors.\r\n\r\nGetting Here: The gardens are a ten-minute walk from Holloway Station. On-site parking is limited, so we strongly recommend arriving by public transport when possible.\r\n\r\nFacilities: A café and gift shop are located near the main gate. Guided tours depart from the visitor center at 11 A.M. and 2 P.M. and are included with admission.</div>\r\n",
