    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 165–167 refer to the following Review.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Reviewed by Priya S.  ★★★★☆\r\nTwo nights at the Cliffside Lodge\r\n\r\nThe Cliffside Lodge was a wonderful base for our weekend hiking trip. Our room was cozy and clean, with a small balcony that looked straight out over the forest. The staff went out of their way to help, even lending us a detailed trail map and packing us a breakfast to go when we set out early.\r\n\r\nThe only downside was the restaurant, which closes at 8 P.M. — earlier than we expected — so we missed dinner one night after a long hike. Fortunately, there&#x27;s a small town nearby with a couple of late options.\r\n\r\nDespite that, I&#x27;d happily return. For nature lovers, the location can&#x27;t be beaten.</div>\r\n",
