    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following Letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Cedar Grove Book Club\r\n88 Larkspur Road, Aldon\r\n\r\nMarch 15\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Whitfield,\r\n\r\nAs a longtime member of the Cedar Grove Book Club, you are among the first to learn about an exciting update to our program. Starting in April, we are introducing a monthly author event, where a guest writer will discuss their work and answer members&#x27; questions.\r\n\r\nBecause you have been a member for more than three years, we are pleased to offer you a reserved seat at the first three events at no extra charge. Simply show your membership card at the door.\r\n\r\nThere is no need to register in advance, and your membership benefits remain otherwise unchanged. You can view the full schedule of guest authors on our website.\r\n\r\nWe are grateful for your continued support and look forward to seeing you there.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nOwen Castellano\r\nMembership Coordinator</div>\r\n",
