    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: hello@partyplus-rentals.com\r\nFrom: m.donovan@brightstepschool.org\r\nSubject: Rentals for school open day\r\nDate: August 2\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI&#x27;m organizing Bright Steps School&#x27;s open day on Saturday, September 13, and would like a quote for some rentals. The event runs from 10:00 A.M. to 3:00 P.M. on our school field.\r\n\r\nWe&#x27;ll need twelve folding tables, sixty chairs, and one large marquee tent in case of rain, for about 200 visitors throughout the day. Everything must be set up and ready by 9:00 A.M., as families start arriving early.\r\n\r\nOur budget is around $700, including delivery, setup, and collection afterward. Could you tell me what you can offer within that range, and confirm whether your team handles the marquee assembly?\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nMaria Donovan</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: m.donovan@brightstepschool.org\r\nFrom: hello@partyplus-rentals.com\r\nSubject: RE: Rentals for school open day\r\nDate: August 3\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Donovan,\r\n\r\nThank you for thinking of Party Plus Rentals. We can meet your needs for September 13 and stay comfortably within your budget.\r\n\r\nOur School Event bundle at $640 includes twelve tables, sixty chairs, and a six-by-nine-meter marquee — ample for 200 guests over the day. The price covers delivery, setup, and same-evening collection. Importantly, our crew fully assembles and secures the marquee for you; you won&#x27;t need to lift a thing.\r\n\r\nWe can arrive at 7:30 A.M. to have everything ready well before 9:00. To reserve the date, we ask for a signed order form and a 20 percent deposit.\r\n\r\nDo let me know if you&#x27;d like to go ahead.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nTheo Marsh\r\nParty Plus Rentals</div>\r\n",
