    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.meridianhotel.com/meetings\r\n\r\nMeridian Hotel — Meeting &amp; Event Packages\r\n\r\nHost your next meeting at the Meridian, in the heart of the business district.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Oakes Room — seats up to 20 — $250 per day\r\n• The Sterling Room — seats up to 50 — $450 per day\r\n• The Grand Ballroom — seats up to 180 — $850 per day\r\n\r\nCatering (per person):\r\n• Coffee Break: coffee, tea, and biscuits — $9\r\n• Working Lunch: sandwiches and salad — $18\r\n• Executive Day: refreshments plus a hot lunch — $24 (save $3)\r\n\r\nEvery room includes a screen, projector, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Reservations must be made at least one week in advance. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of three or more days.\r\n\r\nTo book, e-mail meetings@meridianhotel.com with your date, room, and catering choice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: meetings@meridianhotel.com\r\nFrom: p.osei@vantageconsulting.com\r\nSubject: Meeting room for September 9\r\nDate: August 25\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI&#x27;d like to book a room for a one-day strategy session on Tuesday, September 9. We&#x27;ll have 44 participants, so we need a room that comfortably seats everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease include the Executive Day package for all attendees, since the session runs from 8:30 A.M. to 5:00 P.M. and we&#x27;d like to keep everyone on-site. We will also need a spare microphone for audience questions.\r\n\r\nWould you send an invoice once the booking is confirmed? Our finance department needs it before they can pay.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nPaul Osei\r\nVantage Consulting</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MERIDIAN HOTEL\r\nINVOICE #MH-5106\r\nBill to: Vantage Consulting\r\nEvent date: September 9\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nSterling Room (1 day) ................... $450.00\r\nExecutive Day — 44 attendees × $24 ..... $1,056.00\r\nExtra microphone ........................ $30.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $1,536.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$384.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $1,152.00\r\n\r\nPayment due by September 2. Thank you for choosing the Meridian.</div>\r\n",
