    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 191–195 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">HARBORLIGHT COMMUNITY ARTS\r\nSpring Weekend Workshops\r\n\r\nDiscover a new creative hobby this spring! Our weekend workshops are led by working artists and meet once a week for five weeks. Groups are kept small for personal attention, so book early.\r\n\r\nThis season&#x27;s workshops:\r\n• Introduction to Pottery\r\n• Portrait Drawing\r\n• Beginner Guitar\r\n• Creative Photography\r\n\r\nFees: $100 per workshop, or $180 for any two. All materials are provided except for Creative Photography, for which you must bring your own camera. Arts center members receive a 25 percent discount.\r\n\r\nSign up online at www.harborlightarts.org or at the front desk by March 20.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Spring Weekend Workshop Schedule — Harborlight Community Arts\r\nAll sessions run 10:00–11:30 A.M.\r\n\r\nWorkshop ..................... Day .......... Studio\r\nIntroduction to Pottery ...... Friday ....... Studio A\r\nPortrait Drawing ............. Saturday ..... Studio B\r\nBeginner Guitar .............. Sunday ....... Studio C\r\nCreative Photography ......... Saturday ..... Studio D\r\n\r\nWorkshops begin the weekend of March 28. Please arrive a few minutes early to your first session to sign in.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: info@harborlightarts.org\r\nFrom: t.novak@mail.com\r\nSubject: Possible schedule conflict\r\nDate: March 15\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI signed up for two workshops last week — Portrait Drawing and Creative Photography — and I&#x27;ve just realized they might clash. Could you confirm which days each one meets?\r\n\r\nIf they are both on the same day, I&#x27;d like to switch Creative Photography to Beginner Guitar instead, since I can only attend one workshop per weekend day.\r\n\r\nAlso, I&#x27;m an arts center member, so the member discount should apply to my total.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nTomas Novak</div>\r\n",
