    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 196–200 refer to the following Article.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Peak Fitness Opens Riverside Branch\r\n\r\nPeak Fitness, the regional gym chain, opened its newest branch on Riverside Drive this month — its largest yet and the first to offer a 24-hour swimming pool. The club features a spacious weights floor, a dozen studios for group classes, and childcare during morning sessions.\r\n\r\nTo celebrate, Peak Fitness is waiving the joining fee for anyone who signs up before the end of the month. The chain also launched a new app that lets members book classes in advance and track their workouts, awarding a free guest pass for every twenty visits.\r\n\r\n&quot;Members told us the hardest part was getting a spot in popular classes,&quot; said manager Ivan Petrov. &quot;The app fixes that.&quot;</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">★★★☆☆  Reviewed by Grace O.\r\n\r\nI joined the new Riverside branch mainly for the pool, and I&#x27;ve been really happy with the facilities — clean, spacious, and never too crowded early in the morning. The staff are friendly and the classes are excellent.\r\n\r\nMy one gripe is the app. I tried to book a spin class through it, but it kept logging me out, and my visit count never updated toward the guest pass. I ended up booking at the front desk instead. The staff were helpful and apologized. I&#x27;ll stay for the pool and the classes, but the app needs work.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: grace.o@mail.com\r\nFrom: i.petrov@peakfitness.com\r\nSubject: Thanks for your feedback\r\nDate: February 8\r\n\r\nDear Grace,\r\n\r\nThank you for joining our Riverside branch and for taking the time to review it. I&#x27;m thrilled you&#x27;re enjoying the pool and the classes, but I&#x27;m sorry the app caused you trouble.\r\n\r\nOur technical team has now fixed the log-out problem you described, and the visit-tracking feature is working correctly again. As an apology, I&#x27;ve added two guest passes to your account, which you&#x27;ll see the next time you open the app.\r\n\r\nFeedback like yours is genuinely helpful, and it makes us better. I hope to see you at the pool soon.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nIvan Petrov\r\nManager, Peak Fitness</div>\r\n",
