    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: Employee Mentorship Program\r\n\r\nSummit Technologies is launching a mentorship program designed to help new hires settle into their roles. Experienced staff (1)____ paired with employees who joined within the past year.\r\n\r\nMentors and mentees are expected to meet for one hour every two weeks. Participation is voluntary, but those interested should apply (2)____ the human resources portal before June 20. (3)____ Applicants will then be matched according to their department and career goals.\r\n\r\nWe believe the program will strengthen collaboration and help newcomers grow more (4)____. Questions about the program can be directed to the learning and development office.</div>\r\n",
