    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE\r\n\r\nCrestwave Appliances Introduces Water-Saving Dishwasher\r\n\r\nCrestwave Appliances announced today the launch of the EcoRinse, a dishwasher that uses forty percent less water than standard models. (1)____ The appliance also features a quiet-running motor and a sensor that adjusts the cycle to the size of each load.\r\n\r\nThe company says the EcoRinse (2)____ increasing consumer interest in products that lower household utility costs. &quot;Families want to save money and water at the same time,&quot; said spokesperson Marcus Bell.\r\n\r\nThe dishwasher will go on sale (3)____ July, and pre-orders will open on the company&#x27;s website next week. Retail partners have welcomed the product (4)____ enthusiasm.</div>\r\n",
