    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Ms. Okafor,\r\n\r\nThank you for writing to us about the coffee maker you received earlier this week. We are sorry that the water reservoir (1)____ a small leak at the base.\r\n\r\nAfter reviewing the photos you sent, we believe the seal on the reservoir was not fitted correctly during assembly. We would like to send you a replacement unit right away, and there is no need to return the (2)____ one.\r\n\r\nAs a gesture of goodwill, we have also added a voucher for twenty percent off your next purchase to your account. The voucher is (3)____ for the next six months. (4)____\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nCustomer Relations Team</div>\r\n",
