    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL LIBRARY MEMBERS\r\nAshford Public Library\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that our online catalog and self-checkout kiosks will be unavailable from Wednesday, February 4, at 8:00 P.M. until Thursday, February 5, at 6:00 A.M., while we upgrade our computer system. During this window, members will not be able to renew items or place holds online.\r\n\r\nBorrowing and returning materials at the front desk will continue as normal, and staff will be happy to check out items for you by hand. Any items due on February 5 will not accrue late fees for that day.\r\n\r\nWe apologize for the interruption and thank you for your patience.\r\n— Circulation Services</div>\r\n",
