    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">SWIFTBOX MOVERS\r\nYour local move, made simple.\r\n\r\nRelocating across town? Swiftbox Movers handles homes and small offices with care. Our trained crews arrive fully equipped with padding, dollies, and sturdy boxes, so your belongings reach their new home safely.\r\n\r\nBook your move online before the end of the month and receive a complimentary packing kit, a $60 value. All quotes are flat-rate with no hidden fuel charges, and we offer weekday and weekend slots.\r\n\r\nGet a free, no-obligation estimate in minutes at www.swiftboxmovers.com or call (555) 0173.</div>\r\n",
