    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Hassan Farah (1:22 P.M.): Are we still on track to send the signed contract to Delmont by 4?\r\nWendy Cho (1:24 P.M.): The legal team just returned it with two small edits. I need to update the file and reprint.\r\nHassan Farah (1:25 P.M.): How long will that take?\r\nWendy Cho (1:26 P.M.): Twenty minutes, then I&#x27;ll need a signature from the director. Is she in today?\r\nHassan Farah (1:27 P.M.): She&#x27;s at lunch until 2. I&#x27;ll ask her to swing by your desk when she&#x27;s back.\r\nWendy Cho (1:28 P.M.): That works. We&#x27;ll still make the deadline.</div>\r\n",
