    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Yuki Tanaka\r\nFrom: Gregory Salas, Volunteer Coordinator\r\nSubject: Your shift at the Coastal Cleanup\r\nDate: April 9\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Tanaka,\r\n\r\nThank you for volunteering for the Bayside Coastal Cleanup on Saturday, April 25. I am writing to confirm your assignment and to share a few reminders.\r\n\r\nYou have been placed with the North Beach team, which will meet at the parking lot on Seaview Road at 8:30 A.M. and finish by noon. Please wear closed-toe shoes and dress for the weather; the forecast can change quickly along the coast. We will supply gloves, bags, and grabbing tools, so you need only bring a refillable water bottle.\r\n\r\nIf you are unable to attend, kindly let me know by April 22 so we can adjust our team assignments.\r\n\r\nWe&#x27;re grateful for your support.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nGregory Salas</div>\r\n",
