    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 159–161 refer to the following Memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MEMORANDUM\r\n\r\nTo: All Field Sales Staff\r\nFrom: Renata Voss, Finance Manager\r\nDate: July 1\r\nRe: Switch to the new expense system\r\n\r\nBeginning Monday, July 14, all travel and expense claims must be submitted through our new online tool, ClaimTrack, rather than on paper forms. The change will speed up reimbursements and give you a clearer view of the status of each claim.\r\n\r\nTo file a claim, log in with your company credentials, photograph your receipts, and attach them directly to each line item. Claims under $200 are approved automatically; claims of $200 or more are routed to your regional manager. Reimbursements are issued every other Friday.\r\n\r\nPlease note that paper receipts no longer need to be mailed to the finance office, as the photographed copies are sufficient. If you need help getting started, a short video guide is posted on the staff portal.</div>\r\n",
