    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following Letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Northwind Insurance Group\r\n215 Beacon Street, Calder\r\n\r\nOctober 3\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Okonjo,\r\n\r\nThank you for being a valued Northwind policyholder for the past six years. We are writing to let you know about an enhancement to your home insurance policy that takes effect at your next renewal on November 1.\r\n\r\nStarting then, your policy will automatically include coverage for accidental damage to home electronics, such as televisions and computers, at no additional premium. This benefit is being added for all customers who have held a policy with us for more than five years, as a way of thanking you for your loyalty.\r\n\r\nThere is nothing you need to do; the coverage will appear on your renewal documents, which we will send by mail in mid-October. Should you wish to review the details, you can also find them by logging in to your online account.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your continued trust in Northwind.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nHarold Bright\r\nCustomer Care Manager</div>\r\n",
