    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: quotes@brightpressprint.com\r\nFrom: n.abioye@gladepark-friends.org\r\nSubject: Printing for our autumn festival\r\nDate: August 12\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI coordinate the Friends of Glade Park and would like a quote for printing our autumn festival materials. We need 500 full-color programs (12 pages, folded) and 40 large weatherproof signs to place around the park.\r\n\r\nThe festival is on Saturday, October 4, so we would need everything delivered no later than September 29. Our budget is roughly $1,500, including delivery.\r\n\r\nBecause the programs list dozens of event times, accuracy is critical. Would it be possible to see a proof of the program before you print the full run? Please let me know what you can offer.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nNgozi Abioye</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: n.abioye@gladepark-friends.org\r\nFrom: quotes@brightpressprint.com\r\nSubject: RE: Printing for our autumn festival\r\nDate: August 13\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Abioye,\r\n\r\nThank you for considering Bright Press. We can complete your order within your budget and timeline.\r\n\r\nFor 500 folded 12-page programs and 40 weatherproof signs, the total comes to $1,380, which includes delivery to the park. Our weatherproof signs are printed on rigid board and are rated to withstand rain and wind.\r\n\r\nTo answer your question directly: yes, we always send a digital proof for approval before printing, and for a job with this many event times we would insist on it. Once you approve the proof, printing takes about five business days, so we can comfortably deliver by September 29.\r\n\r\nTo begin, we ask for a 30 percent deposit. Just reply to confirm.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nMarcus Feld\r\nBright Press</div>\r\n",
