    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 181–185 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.craftwell-goods.com/jobs\r\n\r\nCraftwell Goods — Customer Support Specialist (Hillcrest Office)\r\n\r\nCraftwell Goods designs and sells reusable household products online. We are hiring a Customer Support Specialist to help our customers by email and live chat.\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n• Respond to customer questions about orders and products\r\n• Process returns and exchanges accurately\r\n• Flag recurring issues to the product team\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n• At least two years of experience in a customer-facing role\r\n• Clear, friendly written communication\r\n• Comfortable learning new software quickly\r\n• Experience with a help-desk platform such as Zendesk is preferred but not required\r\n\r\nWe offer a supportive team, health benefits, and a generous employee discount on our products. This is a full-time, on-site position.\r\n\r\nTo apply, send your résumé and a brief cover letter to jobs@craftwell-goods.com by June 20.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: jobs@craftwell-goods.com\r\nFrom: priyanka.rao@mail.com\r\nSubject: Application — Customer Support Specialist\r\nDate: June 8\r\n\r\nDear Hiring Team,\r\n\r\nI would like to apply for the Customer Support Specialist position. My résumé and cover letter are attached.\r\n\r\nFor the past three years I have worked in customer support for an online clothing retailer, where I answered up to eighty messages a day by email and chat and handled returns. I take pride in writing clear, warm replies that leave customers feeling looked after. Although the posting lists it as optional, I have also used the Zendesk help-desk platform daily in my current role and could contribute from day one.\r\n\r\nI admire Craftwell&#x27;s focus on reusable goods and would be delighted to support your customers. Thank you for your consideration.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nPriyanka Rao</div>\r\n",
