    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.harborloft-events.com/spaces\r\n\r\nHarbor Loft — Event Space Rates\r\n\r\nHarbor Loft offers bright waterfront rooms for launches, receptions, and team days.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Dockside Room — seats up to 30 — $350 per day\r\n• The Mariner Room — seats up to 70 — $550 per day\r\n• The Grand Pier Hall — seats up to 160 — $950 per day\r\n\r\nCatering (per guest):\r\n• Morning Spread: coffee, juice, and pastries — $11\r\n• Midday Buffet: hot and cold lunch — $21\r\n• All-Day Plan: morning refreshments plus lunch — $28 (save $4)\r\n\r\nEach room comes with a screen, sound system, and free Wi-Fi. Bookings must be confirmed at least twelve days ahead. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of two or more days.\r\n\r\nTo reserve, e-mail bookings@harborloft-events.com with your date, room, and catering choice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: bookings@harborloft-events.com\r\nFrom: e.castillo@brightwave-media.com\r\nSubject: Booking for product launch on November 12\r\nDate: October 22\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI&#x27;d like to book a room for a one-day product launch on Wednesday, November 12. We are expecting 58 guests, so we need a room that comfortably seats that many.\r\n\r\nPlease include the All-Day Plan for everyone, as the event runs from 9 A.M. to 4 P.M. and we&#x27;d like to keep guests on-site for meals. We will also need a portable lectern for the presentations, if one can be arranged.\r\n\r\nCould you send an invoice once the booking is confirmed? Our finance team requires it before releasing payment.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nElena Castillo\r\nBrightwave Media</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">HARBOR LOFT EVENTS\r\nINVOICE #HL-4471\r\nBill to: Brightwave Media\r\nEvent date: November 12\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nMariner Room (1 day) .................... $550.00\r\nAll-Day Plan — 58 guests × $28 ......... $1,624.00\r\nLectern rental .......................... $35.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $2,209.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$552.25\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $1,656.75\r\n\r\nPayment due by November 5. Thank you for choosing Harbor Loft.</div>\r\n",
