    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 196–200 refer to the following Article.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FreshCart Launches Same-Day Delivery in Elmwood\r\n\r\nFreshCart, the online grocery service, expanded to the Elmwood district this month, becoming the first grocer in the area to offer same-day delivery on orders placed before noon. The company sources much of its produce from farms within the region.\r\n\r\nTo mark the launch, FreshCart is waiving delivery fees on first orders through the end of the month. It also introduced an updated app that lets customers save favorite items and earn a $5 credit for every five completed orders.\r\n\r\n&quot;Shoppers told us the number-one thing they wanted was groceries arriving the same day, not two days later,&quot; said regional manager Dahlia Ferris. &quot;So that became our priority for Elmwood.&quot;</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">★★★☆☆  Reviewed by Colin M.\r\n\r\nI signed up for FreshCart mostly because of the same-day delivery — a real help on busy weekdays. My first order arrived within a few hours, the produce was fresh, and I liked not paying a delivery fee.\r\n\r\nMy frustration was the app. I tried to save a list of favorite items so I could reorder quickly, but the list kept disappearing, and my order credit never showed up in my account. I placed the order through the website in the end. Customer service was polite and looked into it. I&#x27;ll keep using FreshCart for the speed, but the app needs fixing.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: colin.m@mail.com\r\nFrom: d.ferris@freshcart.com\r\nSubject: Thank you for your feedback\r\nDate: March 18\r\n\r\nDear Colin,\r\n\r\nThank you for trying FreshCart in Elmwood and for taking the time to review us. I&#x27;m glad the same-day delivery and fresh produce worked well for you, but I&#x27;m sorry the app let you down.\r\n\r\nOur development team has identified and fixed the problem with saved lists, and the order-credit feature is now recording correctly. As an apology, I&#x27;ve added a $15 credit to your account, which you&#x27;ll see the next time you sign in.\r\n\r\nFeedback like yours is genuinely useful; it helps us improve the service. I hope your next order goes smoothly.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nDahlia Ferris\r\nRegional Manager, FreshCart</div>\r\n",
