    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: All Departments\r\nFrom: Information Technology\r\nRe: Email System Upgrade\r\n\r\nOn Saturday, April 12, our email system (1)____ to a new platform with improved storage and stronger security. The upgrade will take place overnight, and access will be unavailable from 11:00 P.M. until 6:00 A.M.\r\n\r\n(2)____ When you log in on Monday morning, all of your existing messages and contacts will already be in place. No action is required on your part beforehand.\r\n\r\nAfter the upgrade, you may notice a slightly different layout, but the main features will work exactly as (3)____. A short guide explaining the changes will be posted on the company intranet. If you experience any problems, please (4)____ a support ticket through the help desk.</div>\r\n",
