    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: New Office Recycling Program\r\n\r\nStarting next Monday, Delmar Publishing will introduce a company-wide recycling program. New sorting bins (1)____ on every floor, clearly labeled for paper, plastic, and general waste.\r\n\r\nEmployees are asked to rinse containers before placing them in the plastic bins and to flatten cardboard boxes to save space. Please do not put food waste in the recycling bins, (2)____ it can contaminate the other materials. (3)____ For this reason, a separate compost bin will be provided in each kitchen.\r\n\r\nWe hope everyone will support this effort to reduce the amount of waste the company sends to landfill. Together we can make a (4)____ difference.</div>\r\n",
