    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Local Bakery Expands to Second Location\r\n\r\nHarborview Bakery, a favorite among residents of the waterfront district, will open a second shop in the Elmwood neighborhood this fall. (1)____ The new location will offer the same fresh breads and pastries that have made the original store so popular.\r\n\r\nOwner Teresa Lim said the decision to expand (2)____ years of steady growth and frequent requests from customers living farther from the coast. &quot;We wanted to bring our bread closer to the people who love it,&quot; she explained.\r\n\r\nThe Elmwood shop will also feature a small seating area (3)____ customers can enjoy coffee and a snack. Ms. Lim expects the new store to hire about a dozen employees, (4)____ several from the surrounding community.</div>\r\n",
