    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Mr. Petrov,\r\n\r\nThank you for letting us know about the delay with your recent furniture order. We sincerely apologize that your dining table (1)____ on the promised date.\r\n\r\nAfter checking with our warehouse, we discovered that the shipment was held up by an unexpected inspection at the port. Your table is now on its way and (2)____ arrive within the next five business days. You will receive a tracking link by email shortly.\r\n\r\nTo make up for the inconvenience, we have refunded your delivery charge in (3)____. The refund should appear on your statement within a week. (4)____\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nCustomer Support Team</div>\r\n",
