    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL GYM MEMBERS\r\nSummit Health Club\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that the swimming pool will be closed for its annual deep clean from Monday, September 7, through Wednesday, September 9. The pool deck, saunas, and changing rooms in the pool wing will also be inaccessible during this time.\r\n\r\nAll other facilities, including the weights floor, studios, and group classes, will operate on their normal schedule. Members who use the pool as part of their routine may wish to try one of our aquatic-alternative classes, listed at the front desk.\r\n\r\nWe apologize for any inconvenience and thank you for your understanding.\r\n— Facilities Team</div>\r\n",
