    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">GREENLEAF LAWN CARE\r\nA healthier yard, all season long.\r\n\r\nTired of spending weekends on yard work? Greenleaf Lawn Care handles mowing, edging, and seasonal cleanups so you can enjoy your garden instead of maintaining it. Our crews are fully insured and use quiet, low-emission equipment.\r\n\r\nSign up for a season package now and your first two visits are half price. There is no long-term contract, and you can pause service anytime with a week&#x27;s notice.\r\n\r\nRequest a free quote at www.greenleaflawncare.com or call (555) 0198 to get on the schedule.</div>\r\n",
