    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Online chat.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Aiden Walsh (3:02 P.M.): Team, the client wants to move the review call from Friday to Thursday. Does that work?\r\nSofia Marchetti (3:04 P.M.): Thursday afternoon is fine for me. Morning I&#x27;m at the supplier site.\r\nAiden Walsh (3:05 P.M.): Good, afternoon it is. Ravi, are you free?\r\nRavi Menon (3:06 P.M.): I have a 2:00, but I can join by 3:30. Can we start then?\r\nAiden Walsh (3:07 P.M.): Let&#x27;s aim for 3:30 so everyone&#x27;s on. I&#x27;ll send an updated invite.\r\nSofia Marchetti (3:08 P.M.): Perfect. I&#x27;ll have the slides ready by then.</div>\r\n",
