    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Beatriz Alvarado\r\nFrom: Nathan Crowe, Alumni Office\r\nSubject: Your talk at the Careers Evening\r\nDate: October 2\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Alvarado,\r\n\r\nThank you for agreeing to speak at our annual Careers Evening for graduating students on November 6. I am writing to confirm the arrangements and to request a couple of items.\r\n\r\nYour session, &quot;Building a Career in Environmental Engineering,&quot; is scheduled for 6:30 P.M. in Lecture Hall C, with a 30-minute slot followed by 15 minutes for questions. Could you please send us a short professional biography of about 90 words, along with the final title of your talk, by October 25 so we can print the program?\r\n\r\nWe will provide a laptop, a clicker, and a microphone; you need only bring your slides on a USB drive. Refreshments for speakers will be served in the foyer from 6:00.\r\n\r\nWe are delighted to have you back on campus.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nNathan Crowe</div>\r\n",
