    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 159–161 refer to the following Memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">MEMORANDUM\r\n\r\nTo: All Reception Staff\r\nFrom: Colette Barnes, Office Manager\r\nDate: March 5\r\nRe: New visitor sign-in procedure\r\n\r\nBeginning Monday, March 16, all visitors must be registered using the new tablet at the front desk rather than the paper logbook. The change will improve building security and let us print visitor badges on the spot.\r\n\r\nWhen a visitor arrives, tap &quot;New Visitor,&quot; enter their name and the person they are meeting, and the tablet will notify that employee automatically and print a badge. Please ask visitors to wear the badge at all times and to return it to the desk when they leave.\r\n\r\nPlease note that contractors and delivery drivers should continue to use the separate loading-dock entrance and do not need to sign in at the front desk. If you have questions, see me before Friday.</div>\r\n",
