    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 165–167 refer to the following Review.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Reviewed by Marisol E.  ★★★★☆\r\nWeekend stay at the Alderwood Inn\r\n\r\nThe Alderwood Inn was a charming choice for a quiet weekend away. Our room was tastefully decorated, the bed was wonderfully comfortable, and the window overlooked a peaceful courtyard garden. Breakfast, included in the rate, featured fresh pastries and locally roasted coffee.\r\n\r\nThe staff were the highlight. When we mentioned it was our anniversary, they surprised us with a small dessert plate that evening — a lovely touch. My only criticism is that the inn has no on-site parking, so we had to use a public lot two blocks away. For a car-free traveler this would be no issue at all.\r\n\r\nWe left relaxed and would gladly return.</div>\r\n",
