    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following Letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Meridian Credit Union\r\n40 Chandler Way, Ashbourne\r\n\r\nJune 5\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Halloran,\r\n\r\nAs one of our long-standing members, you are among the first to hear about a new feature we are adding to our online banking service. Starting July 1, you will be able to deposit checks directly from your phone by simply photographing them, without visiting a branch.\r\n\r\nBecause your account has been open for more than seven years, we are automatically raising your daily mobile deposit limit to $5,000 — double the standard amount — at no cost to you. This higher limit is our way of recognizing your continued membership.\r\n\r\nThere is nothing you need to do. The feature will appear in the latest version of our app, which you can update from your app store. Our member support line is available if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nThank you for banking with Meridian.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nDeborah Lane\r\nMember Services Director</div>\r\n",
