    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: sales@crestlineworkwear.com\r\nFrom: t.mbeki@ridgeway-hotel.com\r\nSubject: New uniforms for our front-desk team\r\nDate: September 2\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI manage the front desk at the Ridgeway Hotel and would like a quote for new uniforms. We need 24 jackets and 24 matching vests embroidered with our hotel logo, in a range of sizes.\r\n\r\nWe would like to have the uniforms in time for our brand relaunch on October 20, so delivery by October 13 would be ideal. Our budget is around $2,000, including embroidery.\r\n\r\nSince fit is important for our team, would it be possible to order a single sample jacket first, so staff can confirm sizing before we place the full order? Please let me know what you can offer.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nThemba Mbeki</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: t.mbeki@ridgeway-hotel.com\r\nFrom: sales@crestlineworkwear.com\r\nSubject: RE: New uniforms for our front-desk team\r\nDate: September 3\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Mbeki,\r\n\r\nThank you for considering Crestline Workwear. We can meet your needs within your budget and timeline.\r\n\r\nFor 24 embroidered jackets and 24 vests, the total comes to $1,860, including logo embroidery and delivery. Our jackets are machine-washable and come in sizes from XS to 3XL.\r\n\r\nTo answer your question: yes, we can send a single sample jacket at no charge so your team can confirm the fit before committing. Once you approve the sample, the full order takes about ten business days, which leaves ample time before October 13.\r\n\r\nTo proceed after approval, we ask for a 25 percent deposit. Just reply to get the sample on its way.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nIngrid Sollberg\r\nCrestline Workwear</div>\r\n",
