    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.claybournestudios.com/hire\r\n\r\nClaybourne Studios — Room Hire Rates\r\n\r\nClaybourne Studios offers modern rooms for rehearsals, seminars, and away-days near the arts district.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Sketch Room — seats up to 18 — $180 per day\r\n• The Palette Room — seats up to 45 — $360 per day\r\n• The Grand Atelier — seats up to 120 — $700 per day\r\n\r\nCatering (per attendee):\r\n• Light Start: coffee, tea, and fruit — $8\r\n• Working Lunch: soup, sandwiches, and salad — $17\r\n• Full Day: refreshments plus lunch — $22 (save $3)\r\n\r\nEvery room includes a projector, movable whiteboards, and free Wi-Fi. Bookings must be confirmed at least ten days in advance. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of three or more days.\r\n\r\nTo reserve, e-mail hire@claybournestudios.com with your date, room, and catering choice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: hire@claybournestudios.com\r\nFrom: j.okafor@meridiandesign.com\r\nSubject: Booking for a team away-day on August 19\r\nDate: August 4\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI&#x27;d like to book a room for a one-day team away-day on Tuesday, August 19. We&#x27;ll have 38 people, so we need a room that comfortably seats everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease include the Full Day catering for all attendees, since we&#x27;re running from 9 A.M. to 5 P.M. and want to keep the group together for meals. We&#x27;ll also need an easel with a paper pad for a brainstorming exercise.\r\n\r\nCould you send an invoice once the booking is confirmed? Our finance office needs it before they can process payment.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nJoy Okafor\r\nMeridian Design</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">CLAYBOURNE STUDIOS\r\nINVOICE #CS-6120\r\nBill to: Meridian Design\r\nEvent date: August 19\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nPalette Room (1 day) .................... $360.00\r\nFull Day catering — 38 attendees × $22 . $836.00\r\nEasel and paper pad ..................... $20.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $1,216.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$304.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $912.00\r\n\r\nPayment due by August 12. Thank you for choosing Claybourne.</div>\r\n",
