    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 191–195 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">RIVERBEND DANCE ACADEMY\r\nAutumn Evening Class Term\r\n\r\nMove to the music this autumn! Our evening dance classes are led by professional instructors and meet once a week for eight weeks. Class sizes are kept small, so early registration is recommended.\r\n\r\nThis term&#x27;s classes:\r\n• Beginner Ballroom\r\n• Contemporary Flow\r\n• Latin Social Dance\r\n• Tap for Beginners\r\n\r\nFees: $120 per class, or $210 for any two. Comfortable clothing is all you need; no special shoes are required for beginners. Academy members receive a 15 percent discount.\r\n\r\nRegister online at www.riverbenddance.com or at the studio desk by September 18.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Autumn Evening Class Schedule — Riverbend Dance Academy\r\nAll sessions run 7:00–8:15 P.M.\r\n\r\nClass ..................... Day .......... Studio\r\nBeginner Ballroom ........ Monday ....... Studio 1\r\nContemporary Flow ........ Wednesday .... Studio 2\r\nLatin Social Dance ....... Wednesday .... Studio 3\r\nTap for Beginners ........ Friday ....... Studio 1\r\n\r\nClasses begin the week of September 22. Please arrive a few minutes early to your first session to check in at the desk.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: info@riverbenddance.com\r\nFrom: hana.svensson@mail.com\r\nSubject: Checking my class schedule\r\nDate: September 14\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI signed up last week for two classes — Contemporary Flow and Latin Social Dance — and I&#x27;m excited to start. However, I want to make sure they don&#x27;t overlap.\r\n\r\nCould you confirm whether the two classes meet on the same evening? I can only attend one class per night, so if they conflict I&#x27;d like to switch Latin Social Dance to Tap for Beginners instead.\r\n\r\nAlso, I&#x27;m an academy member, so I believe the member discount should apply to my total.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nHana Svensson</div>\r\n",
