    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: All Staff\r\nFrom: Human Resources\r\nRe: Introducing the Employee Wellness Program\r\n\r\nWe are excited to announce that a new employee wellness program (1)____ next month. The program will include free fitness classes, healthy snacks in the break rooms, and monthly talks on topics such as sleep and stress management.\r\n\r\n(2)____ Classes will be held in the multipurpose room before and after regular working hours so that everyone can take part.\r\n\r\nParticipation is entirely voluntary, and all activities are offered at no cost to (3)____. A full schedule will be shared on the intranet next week. We encourage you to try at least one activity and see (4)____ it makes you feel.</div>\r\n",
