    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE: Temporary Closure of the Reference Library\r\n\r\nThe company reference library will be closed for renovation from March 3 to March 21. During this time, the reading room (1)____ new shelving, better lighting, and additional quiet study spaces.\r\n\r\nWhile the library is closed, staff may still borrow materials by placing a request through the online catalog. Requested items (2)____ delivered to your department within one working day. (3)____ Digital resources, including e-books and journals, will remain fully available throughout the closure.\r\n\r\nWe apologize for any inconvenience and appreciate your patience. The renovated library will reopen with extended hours, giving everyone more (4)____ to visit.</div>\r\n",
