    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Regional Airport Adds Direct Route to the Coast\r\n\r\nMarland Regional Airport announced this week that it will begin offering direct flights to the coastal city of Seabrook starting in May. (1)____ The route will operate twice daily and is aimed at both business travelers and tourists.\r\n\r\nAirport director Nadia Cole said the new service (2)____ years of requests from local companies that do business on the coast. &quot;Until now, travelers had to change planes twice to reach Seabrook,&quot; she noted.\r\n\r\nOfficials expect the route to be popular (3)____ the summer holiday season, when demand for coastal travel is highest. The airline will use a fuel-efficient aircraft, (4)____ helps keep ticket prices affordable.</div>\r\n",
