    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Ms. Bianchi,\r\n\r\nThank you for contacting us about the online course you enrolled in last week. We are sorry to hear that you were unable to (1)____ the video lessons in the second module.\r\n\r\nWe have looked into the matter and found that a technical error was preventing some videos from loading correctly. Our team has now fixed the problem, and the lessons (2)____ be viewed without any further trouble.\r\n\r\nBecause the issue affected part of your learning experience, we have extended your access to the course by one month at no (3)____ charge. Your new expiration date is already reflected in your account. (4)____\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nLearning Support Team</div>\r\n",
