    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">NOTICE TO ALL RESIDENTS\r\nBirchwood Apartments\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that the hot-water system serving Buildings A and B will be shut off for scheduled maintenance on Thursday, May 21, from 9:00 A.M. to 3:00 P.M. Cold water will remain available throughout the day.\r\n\r\nResidents of Buildings C and D will not be affected. We recommend that affected residents plan any tasks requiring hot water outside these hours. Once service resumes, you may briefly notice discolored water; simply run the tap for a minute or two until it clears.\r\n\r\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your cooperation.\r\n— Building Maintenance</div>\r\n",
