    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">CLEARVIEW WINDOW CLEANING\r\nSee the world a little brighter.\r\n\r\nStreaky windows getting you down? Clearview cleans windows for homes and storefronts, inside and out, using purified water and eco-friendly methods that leave no residue. Our team is fully insured and works around your schedule.\r\n\r\nBook any exterior package this month and get the interior of your ground-floor windows cleaned free. We serve the entire Redfern area, and all quotes are fixed with no surprise charges.\r\n\r\nCall (555) 0162 or book online at www.clearviewwindows.com for a spotless result.</div>\r\n",
