    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Bianca Ford (11:40 A.M.): Did the replacement part for the packaging machine arrive yet?\r\nOwen Reyes (11:42 A.M.): It&#x27;s here, but it&#x27;s the wrong size — too small for the conveyor bracket.\r\nBianca Ford (11:43 A.M.): We can&#x27;t restart the line without the right part. Can the supplier ship a correct one today?\r\nOwen Reyes (11:45 A.M.): I called. They have it in stock and can courier it by 4:00 if we order in the next hour.\r\nBianca Ford (11:46 A.M.): Do it. I&#x27;ll let the floor team know we&#x27;ll be down until late afternoon.\r\nOwen Reyes (11:47 A.M.): Ordering now.</div>\r\n",
