    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–155 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Isabel Moreno\r\nFrom: Terrence Wu, Workshop Organizer\r\nSubject: Your session at the Small Business Expo\r\nDate: February 18\r\n\r\nDear Ms. Moreno,\r\n\r\nThank you for agreeing to lead a workshop at the Riverside Small Business Expo on March 14. I am writing to confirm the details and to request a few materials.\r\n\r\nYour workshop, &quot;Marketing on a Shoestring Budget,&quot; is scheduled for 1:00 P.M. in Seminar Room 2, with a 50-minute slot that includes time for a short activity. Could you please send a one-paragraph description of your session and a list of any handouts you would like us to photocopy by March 2? We can print up to 40 copies of each.\r\n\r\nWe will provide a projector, screen, and microphone. If you would like tables arranged for group work, just let me know and we will set them up in advance.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to a great session.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nTerrence Wu</div>\r\n",
