    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 165–167 refer to the following Review.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Reviewed by Teodora N.  ★★★★☆\r\nVerdant Pro Countertop Blender\r\n\r\nI bought the Verdant Pro to make morning smoothies, and it has quickly become the most-used appliance in my kitchen. It crushes ice and frozen fruit effortlessly, and the results are smooth every time. The jar is large enough for two servings, which is perfect for my partner and me.\r\n\r\nCleaning is refreshingly easy — the jar rinses out in seconds and the base wipes clean. My one gripe is the noise; it is noticeably louder than my old blender, enough that I avoid using it very early in the morning. I also wish it came with a smaller travel cup.\r\n\r\nOverall, it&#x27;s powerful and reliable, and I&#x27;d recommend it without hesitation.</div>\r\n",
