    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following Letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Coastal Reads Magazine\r\n12 Harbor Terrace, Selby\r\n\r\nAugust 20\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Delgado,\r\n\r\nAs a subscriber of long standing, you are among the first to learn about improvements coming to Coastal Reads. Beginning with the October issue, every print subscription will also include full access to our new digital edition, readable on any phone or tablet, at no extra cost.\r\n\r\nBecause you have subscribed continuously for more than four years, we are also extending your current subscription by two free months as a thank-you for your loyalty. Your renewal date will be adjusted automatically.\r\n\r\nYou do not need to do anything to receive these benefits. Instructions for setting up your digital access will arrive with your September issue. If you have any questions, our subscriber support team is glad to help.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading Coastal Reads.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nFiona Whitlock\r\nSubscriptions Manager</div>\r\n",
