    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following Email.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: bookings@lumenframephoto.com\r\nFrom: c.adeyemi@northgate-college.edu\r\nSubject: Photographer for our graduation ceremony\r\nDate: April 3\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI am organizing the graduation ceremony for Northgate College and would like a quote for photography. The ceremony takes place on Saturday, May 30, from 2:00 to 5:00 P.M. in our main auditorium, with roughly 300 attendees.\r\n\r\nWe need coverage of the stage during the ceremony, plus posed photographs of graduates with their diplomas afterward. Our budget for the day is around $1,600.\r\n\r\nBecause the auditorium has unusual lighting, I would feel more comfortable if the photographer could visit the venue beforehand to plan. Is a pre-event site visit something you offer? Please let me know what you can arrange.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nChidi Adeyemi</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: c.adeyemi@northgate-college.edu\r\nFrom: bookings@lumenframephoto.com\r\nSubject: RE: Photographer for our graduation ceremony\r\nDate: April 4\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Adeyemi,\r\n\r\nThank you for considering Lumen Frame Photography. We can cover your graduation on May 30 within your budget.\r\n\r\nOur Ceremony Package at $1,450 includes two photographers for the full afternoon, stage coverage, and a posed-portrait station for graduates. You will receive all edited images through an online gallery within two weeks of the event.\r\n\r\nTo answer your question directly: yes, we always offer a complimentary site visit for events of this size, and given the lighting you describe, we would strongly recommend one. We can arrange it any weekday in the two weeks before the ceremony.\r\n\r\nTo confirm the booking, we ask for a signed agreement and a 20 percent deposit. Just let me know and we&#x27;ll schedule the visit.\r\n\r\nKind regards,\r\nSelina Portman\r\nLumen Frame Photography</div>\r\n",
