    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following Web page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">www.stonegate-conferences.com/rates\r\n\r\nStonegate Conference Rooms — Rates &amp; Packages\r\n\r\nStonegate offers well-equipped rooms for training, seminars, and meetings just off the ring road.\r\n\r\nRooms:\r\n• The Elm Room — seats up to 24 — $220 per day\r\n• The Rowan Room — seats up to 55 — $420 per day\r\n• The Grand Hall — seats up to 140 — $800 per day\r\n\r\nCatering (per delegate):\r\n• Coffee Break: coffee, tea, and biscuits — $9\r\n• Buffet Lunch: hot and cold selection — $19\r\n• Delegate Day: refreshments plus lunch — $25 (save $3)\r\n\r\nEvery room includes a projector, screen, and free Wi-Fi. Bookings must be confirmed at least ten days in advance. A 10 percent discount applies to bookings of three or more consecutive days.\r\n\r\nTo reserve, e-mail bookings@stonegate-conferences.com with your date, room, and catering choice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: bookings@stonegate-conferences.com\r\nFrom: r.haddad@quantumtraining.com\r\nSubject: Booking for a training day on October 6\r\nDate: September 22\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI&#x27;d like to book a room for a one-day training course on Monday, October 6. We&#x27;re expecting 47 delegates, so we need a room that comfortably seats everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease include the Delegate Day package for all attendees, as the course runs from 9 A.M. to 4:30 P.M. and we want to keep everyone on-site for meals. We&#x27;ll also need two extra power strips for laptops, if those can be provided.\r\n\r\nCould you send an invoice once the booking is confirmed? Our accounts department requires it before releasing payment.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nRania Haddad\r\nQuantum Training</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">STONEGATE CONFERENCE ROOMS\r\nINVOICE #SG-7304\r\nBill to: Quantum Training\r\nEvent date: October 6\r\n\r\nDescription ............................... Amount\r\nRowan Room (1 day) ...................... $420.00\r\nDelegate Day — 47 attendees × $25 ...... $1,175.00\r\nPower strips (2) ........................ $16.00\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal ............................... $1,611.00\r\nDeposit received (25%) ................. –$402.75\r\n------------------------------------------------------\r\nBalance due ............................ $1,208.25\r\n\r\nPayment due by September 29. Thank you for choosing Stonegate.</div>\r\n",
