    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 191–195 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">LINDEN LANGUAGE INSTITUTE\r\nWinter Evening Language Courses\r\n\r\nStart a new language this winter! Our evening courses are taught by native-speaking instructors and meet once a week for ten weeks. Classes are small to encourage conversation, so register early.\r\n\r\nThis term&#x27;s courses:\r\n• Beginner Italian\r\n• Intermediate German\r\n• Beginner Japanese\r\n• Conversational Portuguese\r\n\r\nFees: $150 per course, or $270 for any two. A course textbook is included in the fee. Institute members receive a 10 percent discount.\r\n\r\nEnroll online at www.lindenlanguage.org or at the office by December 10.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Winter Evening Course Schedule — Linden Language Institute\r\nAll sessions run 6:30–8:00 P.M.\r\n\r\nCourse ......................... Day ......... Room\r\nBeginner Italian ............... Monday ...... Room 3\r\nIntermediate German ............ Wednesday ... Room 5\r\nBeginner Japanese .............. Wednesday ... Room 2\r\nConversational Portuguese ...... Friday ...... Room 3\r\n\r\nCourses begin the week of December 14. Please arrive a few minutes early to your first class to collect your textbook.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: office@lindenlanguage.org\r\nFrom: lucas.pereira@mail.com\r\nSubject: Checking my course days\r\nDate: December 5\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI enrolled last week in two courses — Intermediate German and Beginner Japanese — and I&#x27;m looking forward to starting. But I want to make sure I haven&#x27;t scheduled a conflict.\r\n\r\nCould you confirm whether the two courses meet on the same evening? I can only take one course per night, so if they clash I&#x27;d like to switch Beginner Japanese to Beginner Italian instead.\r\n\r\nAlso, I&#x27;m an institute member, so I believe the member discount should apply to my total.\r\n\r\nThank you,\r\nLucas Pereira</div>\r\n",
