    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To: Tobias Lindqvist &lt;t.lindqvist@quillmail.com&gt;\r\nFrom: Subscriber Services, Vellacourt Concert Hall\r\nDate: August 14\r\nSubject: Your seats for the new season\r\n\r\nDear Mr. Lindqvist,\r\n\r\nThank you for renewing your subscription for our new concert season, which (1)____ on September 6 with the opening gala. We are writing to let you know about a change to your usual seats in Row F.\r\n\r\nThis summer, the hall is installing a new acoustic canopy above the stage. The canopy will greatly improve the sound throughout the auditorium, but the equipment needed to complete the work will occupy the first six rows of seating until the end of September. (2)____, your seats for the September concerts have been moved to Row K, directly behind your usual location. (3)____\r\n\r\nFrom October onward, you will return to your regular seats in Row F. If the temporary location is not suitable, please contact us before August 31, and we will issue a full (4)____ for the September concerts.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nHelena Marsh\r\nSubscriber Services</div>\r\n",
