    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 135–138 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Bring Your Rooftop to Life with Canopy Hive Partners\r\n\r\nIs the roof of your office building an empty, unused space? (1)____ Canopy Hive Partners installs and manages beehives on commercial rooftops throughout the Dunmore region, allowing your company to support local wildlife without doing any of the work.\r\n\r\nOur certified beekeepers visit every two weeks during the warmer months to inspect the hives and keep the colonies healthy. (2)____, they give short lunchtime talks so that your employees can learn how bees live and why they matter to local farms and gardens.\r\n\r\nEach autumn, the honey from your hives is harvested, (3)____ in jars carrying your company logo, and delivered to your office. Many of our clients give these jars to customers and visitors as gifts.\r\n\r\nInstallation takes less than a day, and our team handles every safety requirement. To arrange a free rooftop (4)____, call 555-0182 or visit www.canopyhive.com.</div>\r\n",
