    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following passage.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FolioScan Go: Portable Document Scanner\r\n\r\nWeighing just 400 grams, the FolioScan Go is small enough to carry in a briefcase yet powerful enough to scan a ten-page contract in under a minute. Simply feed a page into the slot, and the scanner (1)____ a sharp digital copy straight to your phone or laptop.\r\n\r\nThe FolioScan Go runs on a rechargeable battery that lasts for up to 300 pages on a single charge. (2)____, it can be powered directly from a laptop through the included USB cable, so you will never be left without a working scanner on a long business trip.\r\n\r\nEvery purchase comes with a soft carrying case, a cleaning cloth, and a two-year warranty. The free companion app also lets you rename, sort, and share files in seconds, making the FolioScan Go (3)____ for professionals who handle large amounts of paperwork.\r\n\r\nPrice: $129, with free shipping on all orders. (4)____</div>\r\n",
