    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> In this part you will read a selection of texts, such as magazine and newspaper articles, e-mails, and instant messages. Each text or set of texts is followed by several questions. Select the best answer for each question and mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 147–148 refer to the following Text-message chain.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Ana Ribeiro (3:02 P.M.): Viktor, the labels on the Montrose Foods pallets show the Westport depot code. That order is supposed to go to Eastbrook.\r\nViktor Sandberg (3:04 P.M.): All of them? The truck for that order arrives at 4:30.\r\nAna Ribeiro (3:05 P.M.): Twenty-two pallets. And the label printer at my station is jammed, so I can&#x27;t print new ones here.\r\nViktor Sandberg (3:06 P.M.): Use the printer in the returns area. I&#x27;ll send Chidera over to help you relabel them.\r\nAna Ribeiro (3:08 P.M.): Thanks. Even with two of us, it will take a little over an hour.\r\nViktor Sandberg (3:09 P.M.): That&#x27;ll be tight. I&#x27;ll let the driver know he may have to wait a few minutes.</div>\r\n",
