    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following Notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">CITY OF MERRITON\r\nPlanning Department\r\n\r\nNOTICE OF PUBLIC HEARING\r\n\r\nThe Merriton Planning Commission will hold a public hearing on Tuesday, March 10, at 6:30 P.M. in the Council Chamber of City Hall, 200 Ordway Street. The commission will consider an application from Velmont Distribution to build a storage and distribution center on the vacant lot at the corner of Kilbride Road and Station Lane.\r\n\r\nUnder the proposal, a new access road would connect the site directly to Route 9 so that delivery trucks would not need to travel through the residential streets east of the lot. The full plans may be viewed at the Planning Department counter on weekdays from 8:30 A.M. to 4:30 P.M. or online at www.merriton.gov/planning.\r\n\r\nResidents who are unable to attend the hearing may submit written comments to planning@merriton.gov. Comments must be received by noon on Monday, March 9, to be shared with commission members before the hearing.</div>\r\n",
