    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 151–152 refer to the following Information card.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">HOTEL SOLENNE\r\nExpress Check-Out\r\n\r\nLeaving early? There is no need to wait in line at the front desk.\r\n\r\n1. Review the statement of charges delivered to your room on the evening before your departure.\r\n2. If everything is correct, simply drop your key cards into the Express Check-Out box beside the main elevators.\r\n3. Within one hour, a final receipt will be sent to the e-mail address you provided at check-in.\r\n\r\nIf you find an error on your statement or need a printed receipt, please dial 0 from your room phone to reach the front desk before you leave. Your receipt will be ready for you when you come down.\r\n\r\nCheck-out time is 11:00 A.M. Guests may leave their luggage with the concierge until 6:00 P.M. on the day of departure at no charge.</div>\r\n",
