    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 165–167 refer to the following Advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">FRESHFOLD LINEN SERVICES\r\nClean linens, delivered on your schedule\r\n\r\nRunning a hotel, guesthouse, or restaurant leaves little time for laundry. Let Freshfold handle it for you. We collect sheets, towels, tablecloths, and staff uniforms from your premises and return them cleaned, pressed, and folded within 48 hours.\r\n\r\nWhy choose Freshfold?\r\n• Pickups seven days a week, including early mornings\r\n• Rental linens available, so you never need to buy or replace your own\r\n• Every item tracked by barcode, so nothing goes missing\r\n• Same-day service for urgent orders at a small additional charge\r\n\r\nNew customers who sign a six-month service agreement before April 30 will receive their first two weeks of service free. To arrange a no-obligation consultation, call our business team at (555) 0186 or visit www.freshfoldlinen.com.</div>\r\n",
