    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following instructions.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Expo-Lite Portable Display Stand — Setup Guide</span>Thank you for purchasing the Expo-Lite Portable Display Stand. Before you begin, check that all of the parts shown on the enclosed parts sheet are in the carrying case.\r\n131\r\nany pieces are missing, please contact our customer care team at 1-800-555-0143 before attempting to assemble the stand.\r\nFirst, unfold the aluminum frame and lock each of the four hinges into place. Next, attach the printed fabric panel\r\n132\r\nit firmly against the hook-and-loop strips that run along the top and side bars. Then slide the two lighting arms into the slots at the top of the frame. The lights\r\n133\r\nby the rechargeable battery pack included with the stand, so no electrical outlet is needed at your event.\r\nThe entire stand can be set up by one person in less than ten minutes.\r\n134</div>\r\n",
