    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Notice to All Tenants of the Wexford Business Tower</span>Please be advised that both passenger elevators in the Wexford Business Tower will be out of service from 7:00 A.M. on Saturday, 8 June, until 6:00 P.M. on Sunday, 9 June. During this time, technicians\r\n139\r\nnew digital control systems in both elevator cars. The upgrade will reduce waiting times and make the elevators more energy efficient.\r\nWe understand that this work may cause some\r\n140\r\nfor tenants who plan to work in the building over the weekend. The stairways will remain open at all times, and the freight elevator at the rear of the building will remain\r\n141\r\nfor tenants who need to move heavy equipment or deliveries.\r\n142\r\nThank you for your patience while we improve the building’s facilities.\r\n— Wexford Property Management</div>\r\n",
