    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Beginning Monday, 10 February, all visitors to the Halvorsen Pharmaceuticals research campus must be\r\n143\r\nby an employee at all times. Visitors will also be required to sign in at the main reception desk and to wear a visitor badge\r\n144\r\ntheir stay. Badges must be returned to reception when visitors leave the campus.\r\nThese measures are being introduced to protect the confidential research data stored in our laboratories.\r\n145\r\nSimilar procedures have already been adopted at our production site in Rotterdam, and contractors who work on campus regularly will be issued long-term passes.\r\nIf you are expecting a guest, please notify reception at least one working day in advance so that a badge can be prepared.\r\n146\r\nyou have any questions about the new procedures, contact the Facilities Office at extension 4410.</div>\r\n",
