    },
    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Ms. Lindqvist,\r\nThank you for supporting the Aldermoor Museum of Art as a member for the past three years. Your annual membership will expire on 30 April. Renewing is easy: simply complete the enclosed form and return it in the prepaid envelope, or renew online at www.aldermoorart.org/members.\r\nThis year, members who renew before 31 March will also receive two complimentary guest passes, which may be used to bring friends or family to any of our regular exhibitions. As always, members enjoy free admission, a 10 percent discount at the museum shop and café, and invitations to preview evenings for new exhibitions. Our spring preview, for “Light and Water: Nordic Painters 1880–1920,” will take place on 14 May.\r\nWe hope to continue welcoming you to the museum in the year ahead.\r\nSincerely,\r\nMartin Oyelaran\r\nMembership Coordinator</div>\r\n",
    {
