    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–154 refer to the following form.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Norvik Components — Plant 2 Maintenance Request</span>Form\r\nNorvik Components — Plant 2 Maintenance Request\r\nField\r\nDetails\r\nSubmitted by\r\nTomás Herrera, Line Supervisor\r\nDate / Time\r\nTuesday, 14 October, 8:40 A.M.\r\nLocation\r\nAssembly Line 3, Station B\r\nEquipment\r\nConveyor belt motor\r\nPriority\r\nHigh\r\nDescription of problem\r\nThe motor has been making a loud grinding noise since the start of the morning shift and has stopped twice for about five minutes each time. Output on Line 3 is down by roughly half. Please send a technician before the evening shift begins at 6:00 P.M. Until then, four operators from Line 3 have been reassigned to Line 4.\r\nAssigned to\r\nKenji Watanabe, Maintenance Department\r\nStatus\r\nReplacement parts ordered — expected Thursday</div>\r\n",
