    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 161–163 refer to the following coupon.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Marlowe &amp; Finch — Autumn Style Event</span>SAVE 25% on any one full-priced item*\r\nValid at all Marlowe &amp; Finch stores from 1 to 15 October. Present this coupon at the register, or enter code AUTUMN25 at checkout on marloweandfinch.com.\r\nBONUS: Spend $150 or more in a single purchase during the event and receive a free canvas tote bag while supplies last.\r\nNot a Style Club member yet? Join for free in store and enjoy complimentary alterations on all clothing purchases, plus early access to our winter collection.\r\n*Excludes sale items, gift cards, and designer footwear. Limit one coupon per customer per transaction. Cannot be combined with any other offer.</div>\r\n",
