    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Notice to Riverside Business Park Tenants</span>Beginning Monday, 6 October, the east parking structure at Riverside Business Park will undergo resurfacing work.\r\n[1]\r\nThe project will be carried out in three phases, and only one level will be closed at a time so that most parking spaces remain available.\r\nPhase 1 (6–10 October): Level 1 closed. Phase 2 (13–24 October): Level 2 closed. Phase 3 (27 October–31 October): Rooftop level closed. During Phase 3, any vehicle left on the rooftop overnight will be towed at the owner’s expense.\r\n[2]\r\nTenants who normally park on a closed level may use the west parking structure at no additional charge.\r\n[3]\r\nPlease display your Riverside parking permit on your dashboard so that security staff can identify your vehicle.\r\nContractors will work from 7:00 A.M. to 4:00 P.M. on weekdays. Some noise is to be expected, particularly in Building C, which is closest to the east structure.\r\n[4]\r\nQuestions may be directed to the property management office at 555-0187 or parking@riversidebp.com.</div>\r\n",
