    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 181–185 refer to the following advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Blue Fjord Boat Tours — Bergen</span>See Norway’s spectacular coastline from the water! All tours depart from Pier 7 at Bryggen Harbor. Our experienced guides provide commentary in English, Norwegian, and German, and each boat carries a maximum of 60 passengers.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Hello,\r\nI am organizing an outing for our company’s sales team, which will be in Bergen for our annual regional sales meeting later this month. There will be twelve of us, all adults. We would like to take a tour on Saturday, 26 July. We have a dinner reservation at 18:30 that evening, so we must be back at the harbor by 17:00 at the latest. A meal on board would be ideal, as it would save us from having to find a restaurant during the day. One of our colleagues does not eat fish, so please let me know whether other meal options are available. Our hotel is near the fish market, so we can easily walk to the pier.\r\nCould you please confirm availability and the total price? Also, several team members are worried about getting cold out on the water. Should they bring extra clothing? Finally, if the weather is poor on the day, we would prefer to be moved to another tour rather than receive a refund.\r\nThank you,\r\nAnjali Menon\r\nKarsvik Software AS</div>\r\n",
