    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 196–200 refer to the following brochure.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Brightpath Professional Learning — Autumn Workshop Series</span>Brightpath’s one-day workshops help working professionals build practical skills quickly. All workshops run from 9:00 A.M. to 4:00 P.M. at our training center at 220 Quarry Road, Auckland, and the fee includes lunch and all course materials.\r\nAll Brightpath instructors are experienced professionals who continue to work in their fields, and class sizes are limited to 16 participants so that everyone receives individual attention. Each participant receives a certificate of completion at the end of the day. Our center is a ten-minute walk from Britomart Station, and free parking is available behind the building. Workshops often fill up quickly, so early registration is recommended.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Brightpath Workshop Registration</span>Form\r\n· Text 2 of 3\r\nBrightpath Workshop Registration\r\nField\r\nEntry\r\nName\r\nSiosaia Taufa\r\nCompany\r\nPacifica Freight Ltd.\r\nJob title\r\nOperations Coordinator\r\nE-mail\r\nstaufa@pacificafreight.co.nz\r\nPhone\r\n09 555 0162\r\nWorkshop(s)\r\nProject Management Essentials; Introduction to Web Analytics\r\nTotal fee\r\n$442.00\r\nPayment method\r\nCompany credit card\r\nDietary requirements\r\nVegetarian\r\nHow did you hear about us?\r\nRecommended by a colleague\r\nDate submitted\r\n28 March</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Mr. Taufa,\r\nI am writing about your upcoming workshop. Unfortunately, the instructor for Project Management Essentials, Kai Robertson, has been called away on urgent business, so we have had to move the workshop to Saturday, 3 May. The time and location will remain the same. Mr. Robertson sends his apologies and is looking forward to meeting the group on the new date.\r\nIf the new date is not convenient, you may transfer to our Writing for Business workshop instead, or receive a full refund of the fee for that workshop, even though it is now less than ten days before the original date. No additional payment would be required for the transfer. Please let me know your choice by 25 April. Your request for vegetarian meals has been noted and will apply on whichever date you attend.\r\nWe look forward to seeing you. As a reminder, please bring the required equipment to your second workshop on 24 May.\r\nKind regards,\r\nEmma Whitfield\r\nRegistration Coordinator</div>\r\n",
