    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following instructions.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Brightline Fiber Home Gateway — Quick Start Guide</span>Thank you for choosing Brightline Fiber. Your new home gateway combines a modem and a wireless router in a single device. Setup takes about fifteen minutes and requires no special tools.\r\nFirst, connect the gray cable from the wall outlet to the port marked FIBER on the back of the gateway.\r\n131\r\n, plug the power adapter into an electrical outlet and press the power switch. The indicator light on the front of the gateway will flash blue while the device\r\n132\r\nto our network.\r\nOnce the light turns solid white, you can join the wireless network. Simply select the network name on your computer or phone and enter the password. Both are printed on the\r\n133\r\nattached to the bottom of the gateway.\r\nIf the light is still flashing after ten minutes, restart the gateway by holding the reset button for five seconds.\r\n134</div>\r\n",
