    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following press-release.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Nordhaven Power Opens Kestrel Ridge Wind Farm</span>NORDHAVEN, 3 September — Nordhaven Power today announced the opening of its Kestrel Ridge Wind Farm, the largest\r\n139\r\nenergy project in the region. The facility’s 42 turbines will generate enough electricity to supply roughly 60,000 homes each year. The company expects the project to reduce the region’s carbon emissions by about 90,000 tonnes annually.\r\nConstruction began in March of last year and was completed two months ahead of schedule.\r\n140\r\nTo celebrate the opening, Nordhaven Power will host a community open day at the site on Saturday, 14 September. Visitors can tour the control building and speak\r\n141\r\nengineers about how the turbines operate. Free shuttle buses\r\n142\r\nfrom Nordhaven train station every thirty minutes beginning at 9:00 A.M.</div>\r\n",
