    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Ms. Haraldsdóttir,\r\nThank you for selecting the Albaterra Hotel for your company’s sales conference. I am pleased to\r\n143\r\nthat we have reserved the Juniper Ballroom for 18 and 19 November. As requested, the room will be arranged classroom-style for 120 participants, and a projector and two wireless microphones will be provided.\r\n144\r\nPlease review it and let us know of any dietary requirements by 1 November.\r\n145\r\n, a deposit of 30 percent of the total cost is due by 25 October to secure your reservation. The remaining balance can be paid at the end of your event.\r\nIf you have any questions, please call me at 045 555 0194. I will be happy to respond\r\n146\r\nto any requests you may have.\r\nSincerely,\r\nEsteban Montenegro\r\nEvents Manager</div>\r\n",
