    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 149–150 refer to the following memo.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Starting Monday, 14 October, Bayline Suites will replace its magnetic key cards with a mobile access system. Guests who download our app will be able to unlock their rooms using their phones. Traditional key cards will remain available for guests who prefer them.\r\nTo prepare for the change, all front desk and housekeeping employees must attend a one-hour training session. Sessions will be held in the second-floor conference room on 9, 10, and 11 October at 8:00 A.M. and 3:00 P.M. Please sign up for one session through your shift supervisor by Tuesday.\r\nDuring the first week of operation, a technician from Keyora Systems will be on site to help with any problems. Thank you for your cooperation.</div>\r\n",
