    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 153–154 refer to the following letter.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Dear Mr. Akinwale,\r\nI am pleased to inform you that your application to sell at the Westbrook Farmers’ Market this season has been approved. Our selection committee was particularly impressed by the variety of heirloom tomatoes and peppers grown on your farm.\r\nThe market runs every Saturday from 3 May to 27 September, 7:00 A.M. to 1:00 P.M. You have been assigned stall 23, near the east entrance. Vendors should arrive no later than 6:15 A.M. to set up.\r\nThe seasonal stall fee of $450 is due by 15 April. You may pay by bank transfer or by check made out to Westbrook Market Association. Please also send us a copy of your liability insurance certificate before the first market day.\r\nWe look forward to welcoming you to the market.\r\nSincerely,\r\nMaren Solberg\r\nMarket Manager</div>\r\n",
