    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 155–157 refer to the following web-page.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">www.lumenandlark.com/corporate</span>Lumen &amp; Lark Event Studio — Corporate Events\r\nAbout us: Since 2011, Lumen &amp; Lark has planned more than 900 corporate events across the Pacific Northwest, from product launches for 50 guests to industry conferences for 3,000 attendees.\r\nOur services: Venue selection and contract negotiation • Catering coordination with more than 40 approved partners • Audiovisual setup and on-site technical support • Guest registration and badge printing\r\nHow it works: Book a free 30-minute consultation through this page. Within five business days, your dedicated planner will send you a detailed proposal and cost estimate. Once you approve the proposal, a 25 percent deposit reserves your date.\r\nPlease note: For events with more than 500 guests, we recommend contacting us at least nine months in advance. Transportation for guests is not included in our services but can be arranged through our partner, Cascade Coachlines.</div>\r\n",
