    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 158–160 refer to the following invoice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Redline Auto Care — Invoice No. 20417</span>Invoice\r\nRedline Auto Care — Invoice No. 20417\r\nRedline Auto Care, 118 Forge Street, Brackford\r\nDate:\r\n12 February\r\nCustomer:\r\nSolen Agritech Ltd. (Fleet Manager: Hyun-woo Baek)\r\nVehicle:\r\n2022 Vantor delivery van, fleet no. 6\r\nDescription\r\nQty\r\nUnit price\r\nAmount\r\nOil and filter change\r\n1\r\n$89.00\r\n$89.00\r\nFront brake pads (parts)\r\n1 set\r\n$124.00\r\n$124.00\r\nLabor — brake service (hours)\r\n2\r\n$75.00\r\n$150.00\r\nWiper blades\r\n2\r\n$18.50\r\n$37.00\r\nTire rotation (included in service plan)\r\n1\r\n$0.00\r\n$0.00\r\nSubtotal\r\n$400.00\r\nFleet customer discount (10%)\r\n−$40.00\r\nTotal due\r\n$360.00\r\nPayment is due within 30 days of the invoice date.\r\nTechnician’s note: The rear tires are wearing unevenly and should be replaced within the next 3,000 kilometers. We will contact you to schedule this work. Next routine service due: August.</div>\r\n",
