    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 161–163 refer to the following advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Explore the Saltmarsh Coast by Rail!</span>The Saltmarsh Coast Explorer Pass gives you unlimited travel on all regional trains between Port Averly and Kestwick for three, five, or seven consecutive days. Pass holders also enjoy free entry to the Averly Maritime Museum and 15 percent off harbor boat tours in Linmouth.\r\nPrices: 3-day pass $69 • 5-day pass $99 • 7-day pass $129. Children under 12 travel free when accompanied by an adult pass holder.\r\nPasses can be purchased online at www.saltmarshrail.com or at the ticket office of any staffed station. Passes bought online are sent by e-mail and can be shown on a mobile phone.\r\nNew this year: Bicycles may be brought on board free of charge on weekdays. On Saturdays and Sundays, a bicycle reservation ($5) is required because space is limited.</div>\r\n",
