    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 164–167 refer to the following online-chat-discussion.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Yusuf Demirci 9:02 A.M.: Morning, everyone. Brisa Coffee just moved our campaign presentation up to this Thursday instead of next Monday.\r\nAnneliese Kraus 9:04 A.M.: Thursday? The video ads won’t be finished until Friday at the earliest.\r\nYusuf Demirci 9:05 A.M.: I know. We could show them the storyboards and a rough cut of the first ad instead.\r\nTanvir Hossain 9:06 A.M.: I can have a rough cut ready by Wednesday afternoon, but only if Anneliese sends me the voice-over recordings today.\r\nAnneliese Kraus 9:08 A.M.: Consider it done. They’ll be in the shared folder by noon.\r\nMarisol Ybarra 9:10 A.M.: What about the print materials? Should I still order the sample posters from the printer?\r\nYusuf Demirci 9:11 A.M.: Yes, but ask for express delivery. We’ll need them by Wednesday.\r\nMarisol Ybarra 9:12 A.M.: The express fee is $80. Is that within our budget?\r\nYusuf Demirci 9:14 A.M.: That’s fine. I’ll also ask them to book the large meeting room at their headquarters. They’re inviting their regional managers.\r\nMarisol Ybarra 9:15 A.M.: Great. I’ll get the order in right away.</div>\r\n",
