    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 168–171 refer to the following schedule.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Fernhill Regional Agricultural Show — Saturday, 16 August</span>Admission is $12 for adults; children under 14 enter free.\r\n[1]\r\nFree parking is available in the north field, and a shuttle bus runs every 20 minutes from Fernhill station.\r\n[2]\r\nPlease note that the irrigation talk was originally scheduled for Sunday but has been moved to Saturday because of the speaker’s travel plans.\r\n[3]\r\nIn the event of heavy rain, the tractor parade will be canceled.\r\n[4]\r\nAll other events are held in covered areas and will take place as scheduled.</div>\r\n",
