    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 181–185 refer to the following advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Corvanta Business Connect — Plans for Growing Businesses</span>Keep your team connected with Corvanta’s new business plans. Every plan includes unlimited calls within the country, free installation, and 24-hour technical support.\r\nWhether you run a small café or a busy office, Corvanta has a plan that grows with you. Our fiber network now reaches more than 90 percent of businesses in the metropolitan area, and our customers have rated us the region’s top business provider three years in a row.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Hello,\r\nI own a travel agency with offices in two neighborhoods of the city. We currently have fourteen employees, each of whom needs a mobile line, and we are hiring two more agents in September. Our current provider’s internet connection is too slow for the video calls we hold with our hotel partners, so we need a speed of at least 500 Mbps.\r\nWe have been with our current provider for six years, and apart from the internet speed, we have been fairly satisfied with the service. However, our contract ends on 31 August, and I would like the new service to be running at both offices before then.\r\nI am interested in the plan that would give everyone a line without our having to pay for additional ones. Before I sign, I would like to know whether the half-price offer still applies if installation cannot be completed until August, since our second office will not open until then. Also, could someone visit our main office to explain the plan to my business partner, who handles our finances? We are both available most weekday mornings.\r\nRegards,\r\nXimena Alcántara\r\nOwner, Alcántara Travel</div>\r\n",
