    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 186–190 refer to the following invoice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Gatherwell Event Rentals — Invoice GW-4471</span>Invoice\r\n· Text 1 of 3\r\nGatherwell Event Rentals — Invoice GW-4471\r\nDate:\r\n2 June\r\nCustomer:\r\nLeilani Kahale, Kahale Marketing Group\r\nEvent:\r\nProduct launch, 7 June\r\nVenue:\r\nCanal House Loft, 40 Harbor Walk\r\nItem\r\nQty\r\nUnit price\r\nAmount\r\nRound tables (seat 8)\r\n12\r\n$15.00\r\n$180.00\r\nFolding chairs, white\r\n96\r\n$3.50\r\n$336.00\r\nTable linens, ivory\r\n12\r\n$9.00\r\n$108.00\r\nPortable stage (4 m × 3 m)\r\n1\r\n$275.00\r\n$275.00\r\nDelivery and pickup\r\n1\r\n$120.00\r\n$120.00\r\nSubtotal\r\n$1,019.00\r\nDeposit received (25 May)\r\n−$250.00\r\nBalance due\r\n$769.00\r\nThe balance is due upon delivery. Items will be delivered on 7 June between 8:00 and 10:00 A.M. and collected on 8 June after 9:00 A.M.\r\nPlease make sure that someone is at the venue to receive the delivery and sign the delivery slip. Items must be stacked and ready for collection at the pickup time; a $40 fee applies if our crew has to wait more than 30 minutes.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">To whom it may concern:\r\nI am writing about invoice GW-4471 for our product launch yesterday. Your truck arrived at the Canal House Loft at 11:15 A.M., well after the delivery window stated on the invoice. As a result, my staff had to rush to set up the tables and stage before our guests arrived at noon.\r\nIn addition, two of the twelve table linens were stained and could not be used, so we had to cover those tables with cloths we borrowed from the venue. I have attached photographs of the stained linens.\r\nWe have rented from Gatherwell for several events over the past two years and have always been pleased with the quality of your furniture, which is why these problems were so disappointing. To be fair, the stage and chairs were in excellent condition, and your crew collected everything on time this morning.\r\nI paid the balance in full to your driver, but I believe we are entitled to a partial refund under your customer satisfaction policy. Please let me know how you intend to handle this.\r\nLeilani Kahale\r\nEvents Director, Kahale Marketing Group</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Gatherwell Event Rentals — Customer Satisfaction Policy</span>Gatherwell Event Rentals is committed to making every event a success. If you are not satisfied with any part of our service, please contact our billing department at billing@gatherwellrentals.com. The following terms apply to all rental orders.\r\nLate delivery: If a delivery arrives more than 60 minutes after the end of the scheduled delivery window, the delivery and pickup fee will be refunded in full.\r\nDamaged or unusable items: Customers will receive a full refund of the rental cost of any item reported as damaged or unusable within 48 hours of delivery. Photographs of the items must be provided.\r\nCancellations: Orders canceled at least seven days before the event date will receive a full refund of the deposit. For cancellations made after that point, the deposit will not be returned.\r\nAll refunds are issued to the original method of payment within ten business days.</div>\r\n",
