    },
    "</h2>\r\n<div class=\"dirs\"><b>Directions:</b> Read the texts that follow. A word, phrase, or sentence is missing in parts of each text. Four answer choices for each question are given below the text. Select the best answer to complete the text. Then mark the letter (A), (B), (C), or (D) on your answer sheet.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 131–134 refer to the following notice.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Attention, Brightfield Mall Tenants and Staff</span>The north parking garage will be closed for resurfacing from Monday, 14 April, through Sunday, 27 April. During this period, all store employees\r\n131\r\nto park in the overflow lot on Carver Street. Customer parking in the south garage will not be affected.\r\nA free shuttle bus will run between the Carver Street lot and the mall’s east entrance every ten minutes\r\n132\r\n7:00 A.M. and 10:00 P.M. Staff who work later than 10:00 P.M. may request a security escort to their vehicles by calling the front desk.\r\nWe understand that this\r\n133\r\nmay cause some inconvenience, particularly during the busy Easter weekend.\r\n134\r\nPlease direct any questions to the mall management office at extension 220.\r\nThank you for your cooperation.\r\nBrightfield Mall Management</div>\r\n",
