    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 139–142 refer to the following advertisement.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Is Your Car Ready for Winter?</span>Cold weather is hard on vehicles. That is why Halvorsen Auto Care is offering a complete winter inspection throughout November. Book before 30 November and pay just $39, a\r\n139\r\nof 40 percent off our regular price.\r\nOur certified technicians will check your battery, tires, brakes, lights, and heating system, and they will top up your windshield washer fluid with a winter formula. The inspection takes\r\n140\r\n45 minutes, so there is no need to leave your car with us. Simply relax in our comfortable customer lounge.\r\n141\r\nCustomers who have the inspection done will also receive a coupon for 15 percent off any repairs\r\n142\r\nduring the inspection. The coupon is valid until 31 January.\r\nTo book, call 555-0176 or visit any of our three locations in Eastfield, Morton, and Barrow Hill.</div>\r\n",
