    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 143–146 refer to the following instructions.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Installing Your ShelfLink Digital Price Labels</span>Before you begin, make sure that the ShelfLink base station is plugged in and\r\n143\r\nto your store’s wireless network. The small light on the front of the station will turn blue when it is ready.\r\nNext, attach each label to the front edge of the shelf using the adhesive strip on the back. Press\r\n144\r\nfor about ten seconds so that the label stays in place. Labels should be placed at least five centimeters apart.\r\nThe labels will display prices automatically once they are linked to your inventory system.\r\n145\r\n, you will need to scan the barcode on each label with the ShelfLink app on your tablet or smartphone. The app will confirm each successful link with a green check mark.\r\n146\r\nOnce all labels are linked, any price change you make in your inventory system will appear on the shelves within two minutes.</div>\r\n",
