    "\r\n\r\n<div class=\"ref\">Questions 176–180 refer to the following schedule.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\"><span class=\"ttl\">Brennan Cooking School — October Evening and Weekend Workshops</span>All ingredients, aprons, and equipment are provided, and participants take home everything they make. Each workshop is limited to 12 participants.\r\nParticipants who cancel at least 72 hours before a workshop receive a full refund. Later cancellations are not refunded, but the registration may be transferred to another workshop for a $10 fee. Students enrolled in the school’s Professional Chef program receive a 20 percent discount on all workshops.\r\nRegistration opens two weeks before each workshop and can be completed online at www.brennancooking.com or at our front desk. Gift certificates are available in any amount.</div>\r\n<div class=\"passage\">Hello,\r\nI am registered for the pasta workshop this Saturday morning, but I have just been asked to work that day and will not be able to attend. I realize it is too late for a refund, but I would like to transfer to the same workshop later in the month, if any places are still available. I understand there is a small charge for this, and I am happy to pay it.\r\nAlso, my husband would like to join me for a class. He is a keen baker and was hoping to take the bread workshop, but he works late on Wednesdays. Will that workshop be offered again on a weekend in November? If so, we would both like to sign up for it.\r\nBy the way, I took the knife skills class last month and enjoyed it very much. Mr. Achebe was an excellent teacher, and I have been recommending your school to all my friends.\r\nThank you for your help.\r\nDelphine Moreau</div>\r\n",
    {
